<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">1 Wafal</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Wafalume</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha mwanduso cha Wafalume</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAFALUME WA MWANDUSO</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Pfitabu pfa Wafalume wa kwanza na Wafalume wakeli umwande tsapfikala chitabu chimwe chikulu. Chanza ukugholeka pfiwe pfitabu pfili ahala Ibibilia ya ghumwande ghendo ikemighwa Septuaginti, iyandikighwe kwa lugha ya chiyunani hailapfighwe. Ng'aimanyika baye nani iyandike ipfitabu apfino pfili pfa wafalume wakwanza na wafalume wa keli, au iyapfikile pfikale apfino pfapfili.</para>
  <para style="ip">Imunu iyandike ipfitabu apfino tsakasola simulitsi nyingi tsa ghumwande hayapfandike ipfitabu apfino pfili, lola (1 Wafalme 11.41, 14.19, na 14.29). Pfipfila ng'aimanyike baye pfitabu apfino pfandikighwe tsuwachi na pfikighwe tsuwachi pfiwe apfino pfapfili. Yakoneka ghendo tsapfimalitsika kwandikighwa ahala mfalume Yekonia hayalekelighwe kulawa kuna isi ya utumwa ya Babeli mna ghumwaka ghwa miya tano na sitini na moja ng'ana Yesu yoneke baye. Iwanu wengi iwasomile ng'ani Ibibilia wotoghola ghendo ka ipfitabu apfino pfili pfandikighwa miyaka mingi ya ghumwande kubita ayo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pfitabu pfa Wafalume wa kwanza na Wafalume wakeli pfotupetela tsimbuli tsa chila mfalume wa Isiraeli na Yuda kulawa mna ghamatsuwa ghayatawale mfalume Selemani, ahala tsiisi tsa Isiraeli na Yuda hatsikalile isi imwe. Pfipfila pfotulongela apfila ufalume wa Isiraeli pfaugholeke na kuwa falume mbili, na chila ufalume kuwinza ighali ghake, mbaka ahala tsifalume atsino hatsitowighwe na wanu wa isi tsingi, mbaka iwanu wake kughalighwa kuna isi tsa utumwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Imunu iyandike kabama twetwe tumanya apfila chila mfalume pfayakalile na Imulungu, ka tsakamuwinza ghendo Imulungu au tsakamleka. Wafalume wamwenga tsawatenda ighanoghile hambele ha Imulungu, (2 Wafalme 18.3), wafalume wangi tsawetenda ghehile hambele ha Imulungu (2 Wafalme 21.2). Imunu iyandikike kotulongela mwatsi ka isi yodaha kubweda ka mfalume wake kokala pfinoghile na Imulungu, lekeni ka ng'okala ghoya baye na Imulungu isi yake itsoghaya. Wafalme 17.7 yotulongela apfila Waisiraeli pfawaghoghighwe na kughalighwa kuna isi ya utumwa. Tsawaghalighwa ako kwaaapfila Waisiraeli tsawamtendela nzambi Imulungu na waitambikila milungu ingi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna ichitabu cha Wafalume wa kwanza</para>
  <para style="io1">Selemani mwanaghe Daudi pfayawile Mfalume na tsimbuli tsa ufalume wake mna Isiraeli. Sula 1-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Ufalume wa Israeli na Yuda pfaugholoke, na tsotusumulila apfila iwafalume wa isi tsino mbili pfawali. Sula 12-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsimbuli tsa nabii Eliya na yeye pfayakalile na mfalme Ahabu wa Israeli. Sula 17-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Ukumala kwa ufalume wa Ahabu mna isi ya Israeli, na tsotulongela tsimbuli tsa wafalume wangi iwatawale ahaya yeye hayamalitse. Sula 20-2</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Daudi na Abishagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Mfalume Daudi hayalalile ghendo, iwatumighwa wake wang'ali womghubika magholole, lekeni ng'atsumbuke baye. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Apfo iwatumighwa wake wamlongela, “Mkulu wetu, leka tukubamile mwali yang'ana yammanye mmale, yakale naghwe na yakulolese, yawase hamwe na ghweghwe, naghwe utsumbuke.” <verse eid="1KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Nawo wambama mwali yanoghile muisi mwose mwa Isiraeli, wamwona mwali yumwe iyakemighwe Abishagi, iyokala mna ghumji ghwa Shunami, wamghalila mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Imwali ayo tsakanogha sideke, kamlela mfalume, na kamsang'anila, lekeni mfalume ng'awasile naye ka mwehe wake baye.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adoniya kebamila ufalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Matsuwa agho Adoniya, mwana wa Daudi iyelekighwe na Hagiti, tsaketamba ka yeye yuyo iyatsakuwa mfalume. Keka ghoya mituka yake ya ukukweghighwa na falasi, na iwadina falasi, na wanu hamsini iwotsuma wamlongolele yeye. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Lekeni Daudi, aba wake ng'ammanile baye hata mala lumwe, wala ng'amghutsile baye heule yang'ali yotenda apfo. Yeye tsa msongolo yana ichihanga ichinoghile ng'ani, na tsakanza koneka Absalomu kuya yeye Adoniya. <verse eid="1KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adoniya tsakadeta na Yoabu, iyelekighwe na Seruya, na mtambika Abiatari, nawo watoghola ukumwapfila Adoniya. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Lekeni mtambika Sadoki, na Benaya, mwanaghe Yehoyada, na nabii Nasani, na Shimei, na Rei na wabetetsi wa Daudi, walema ukumwapfila Adoniya.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Adoniya kalapfa nambiko, kachinja ng'olo na ng'ombe na wana wa ng'ombe iwanonile, hana libambalawe lya Zoheleti, habehi na imbwibwi ya Eni Rogeli, kawakema kuna ichihungo acho ndughu tsake wose, awala iwanaghe mfalume Daudi, na iwatumighwa wa mfalume iwang'ali wokala Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />Lekeni ng'amkemile baye nabii Nasani, wala Benaya, wala wabetetsi wa mfalume, wala Selemani indughu yake.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani kakwikighwa yawe mfalume.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Baho Nasani kamlongela Batisheba, wenye wake Selemani, kalonga, “Pfihi ng'uhulike baye ka Adoniya, iyelekighwe na Hagiti kawa mfalume aku mkulu wetu Daudi ng'apfimanyile baye? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Leka nene nikulongele cha ukutenda ka kobama kwikombola na uwe mghima ghweghwe na mwanagho Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />Ghenda kwa mfalume Daudi ukamlongele apfino, ‘Pfihi ng'unilahile nene baye mtumighwa wako, ghwe mfalume, ahala haulongile, imwanagho Selemani katsakuwa mfalume na katsokalila ichighoda changu cha ufalume, heule lelo Adoniya kawa mfalume?’ ” <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Nasani kalonga keli, “Hautsakuwa ung'ali kolonga na mfalume, nene nitsakwingila na kulonga ka ghaulongile gholongesa.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Apfo Batisheba kengila mng'anda kumlola mfalume mna ichiheleto chake cha ukuwasa, naye mfalume tsakalala ghendo, na Abishagi, ipinga iyolawa Shunami, yang'ali yomlela mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Batisheba kamwinamila mfalume, naye mfalume kamghutsa, “Chaubama choni?”<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Naye kamwidika, “Mkulu wangu, ghweghwe mwenyegho tsakunilahila ghendo kwa IMNDEWA Imulungu wako, nene imtumighwa wako, ahala haulongile, ‘Selemani imwanagho katsakuwa mfalume na katsokalila ichighoda changu cha ufalume.’ <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Lelo ulole sambi Adoniya kawa mfalume, na ghweghwe mfalume, mkulu wangu ng'umanyile baye. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Kalapfa nambiko kwa kuchinja wang'ombe wengi, wana wa ng'ombe wengi iwanonile, na wang'olo wengi, na kawakema iwana wose wamale wa mfalume, na mtambika Abiatari, na Yoabu imkulu wa ing'ondo. Lekeni Selemani imtumighwa wako ng'amkemile baye. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Ghwe mfalume, mkulu wangu, tsinenge tsose tsa wanu wa Isiraeli tsokulolela ghweghwe, wobama uwalongele nani iyatsokalila ichighoda chako cha ufalume, yasole hanu hako. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Ka ng'utenda apfo baye, nene na imwanangu Selemani tutsakoneka tutotsa ahala ghweghwe hautsakufa.”<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Batisheba hayang'ali yolonga na mfalume, nabii Nasani kapfika. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Iwanu wamlongela mfalume apfino, “Nabii Nasani katsa, kabaha.” Naye Nasani hayampfikile mfalume kamwinamila mbaka uhanga wake udonza hasi. <verse eid="1KI 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Naye Nasani kalonga, “Mkulu wangu mfalume, angu tsakulonga ka Adoniya katsakuwa mfalume ahala ghweghwe haumalitsa ufalume wako, na kokalila ichighoda chako cha ufalume? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Leloli kahulumka, kaghenda kutambika, kachinja wang'ombe wengi, wana wa ng'ombe wengi iwanonile, na wang'olo wengi, kawakema wana wose wa mfalume, na iwakulu wa ing'ondo, na mtambika Abiatali, na ulole lelo wakuja na kunwa na wolonga, ‘Imulungu yakwike ukale matsuwa mengi mfalume Adoniya.’ <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Lekeni ng'anikemile nene baye imtumighwa wako, wala mtambika Sadoki, wala Benaya imwanaghe Yehoyada, wala mtumighwa wako Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Pfihi alino kulitenda ghweghwe mkulu wangu, bila kutulongela twetwe watumighwa wako nani iyatsokalila ichighoda chako cha ufalume, yasole hanu hako?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Naye mfalume Daudi kalonga, “Nikemeleni Batisheba.” Batisheba kamghendela mfalume kema hambele hake. <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Mfalume kelaha kalonga, “Nelaha ghendo kwa IMNDEWA wangu iyali mgima, iyanikombole mna maghayo ghangu ghose, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />ka pfanilahile hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, hanilongile, ‘Mwanagho Selemani kakuwa mfalume, katsosola hanu hangu, na katsokalila ichighoda changu cha ufalume.’ Apfi pfipfo pfanitsotenda leloli.”<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Baho Batisheba kamwinamila mfalume, uhanga wake udonza hasi, kalonga, “Mkulu wangu, mfalume Daudi IMNDEWA yamwike yakale matsuwa mengi!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Naye mfalume Daudi kalonga, “Nikemeleni mtambika Sadoki, nabii Nasani, na Benaya mwanaghe Yehoyada.” Nawo wamghendela mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />Mfalume kawalongela, “Msoleni mwanangu Selemani hamwe na watumighwa wangu, mumdinitse Selemani mna punda falasi wangu, mhulumke mumghale kuna imbwibwi ya Gihoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Kuko mtambika Sadoki na nabii Nasani wakambakatse mapfuta, na wamwike yawe mfalume wa Isiraeli. Kuya mtowe malati na mkemelele mlonge, ‘Imulungu yamwike yakale matsuwa mengi mfalume Selemani!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Kuya mgheluke mmuwinze, naye katsakutsa yakalile ichighoda changu cha ufalume, yasole hanu hangu, kwaapfila yeye yuyo yanimsaghule yawe mtawala wa Isiraeli na Yuda.”<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Benaya, imwana wa Yehohada kamwidika mfalume, “Pfipfo! Tutsotenda pfipfo, IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa mkulu wangu mfalume, naye yalonge pfipfo. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Ka IMNDEWA pfayakalile hamwe na mkulu wangu mfalume, pfipfila yakale hamwe na Selemani ili ufalume wake uwe mkulu kubita aula wa mkulu wangu mfalume Daudi.”<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Baho wahulumka, mtambika Sadoki, nabii Nasani, Benaya imwana wa Yehoyada, Wakereti, na Wapeleti, wamdinitsa Selemani mchanya mwa punda falasi wa mfalume Daudi, wamghala mbaka Gihoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Sadoki kasola imembe ina ghamapfuta iyaisolile kuna lihema lienzeluke, kambakatsa ghamapfuta Selemani. Kuya watowa malati, iwanu wose wakemelela walonga, “Imulungu yamwike yakale matsuwa mengi mfalume Selemani!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Baho iwanu wose wamuwinza, aku wotowa filimbi, wopfina na kudeng'elela, mbaka isi yose ihighisika kwa kukemelela kwao.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Lelo Adoniya na iwagheni wake hawang'ali womalitsa ichihungo, wahulika tsimalati tsotowighwa. Naye Yoabu kaghutsa, “Angu ukukemelela ako kuna ghumji kuna choni?” <verse eid="1KI 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Hata ng'ana yamalitse ukulonga, Yonasani, mwanaghe imtambika Abiatari kapfika. Naye Adoniya kamlongela, “Wingile mng'anda, ghweghwe kwa munu yunoghile, koghala mbuli tsinoghile.”<verse eid="1KI 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Yonasani kamwidika, “Baye! Mkulu wetu mfalume Daudi kamwika Selemani yawe mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Mfalume Daudi kawatuma mtambika Sadoki, na nabii Nasani, na Benaya mwanaghe Yehoyada, na Wakereti, na Wapeleti waghende na Selemani. Nawo wamdinitsa mna punda falasi wa mfalume, <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />wahulumka waghenda Gihoni, kuko mtambika Sadoki na nabii Nasani wambaka ghamapfuta yawe mfalume. Sambi wakuya aku wodeng'elela, na ukukemelela kwao kuko kwauhulika, kwenela mna ghumji ghose. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Sambi Selemani kakalila ichighoda cha ufalume. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Kuya iwatumighwa wa mfalume nawo watsa kumwing'a hongela mfalume wetu Daudi walonga, ‘Imulungu wako yalitende taghwa lya Selemani limanyike kubita lyako, na ufalume wake uwe mkulu kubita wako.’ Naye mfalume kenama mlusatsi, <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />kalonga, ‘Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, iyamsaghule munu wa ukukalila ichighoda changu cha ufalume, na iyanyikile nighone aghano.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Apfo wagheni wa Adoniya tsaweduka ghendo, wapwililika, woka chila munu na nzila yake. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Lekeni Adoniya kwa kumpfuka Selemani katsumila kuna imatsabahu, na kaghenda kukinda tsimembe tsa imatsabahu yahone. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Na Selemani kahulika ka Adoniya yang'ali yompfuka yeye, na yang'ali yokinda tsimembe tsa imatsabahu aku kolonga, “Tanu nobama mfalume Selemani yanilahile ka ng'atsong'oma baye nene mtumighwa wake.”<verse eid="1KI 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Selemani kedika kalonga, “Ka ning'amwona kahela totso, hata mvili yake imwe sitsoilaghatsa hasi baye, lekeni ning'amwona kana totso, ayo kakufa ghendo.” <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Apfo mfalume Selemani katuma wanu wakamkeme Adononiya kulawa kuna imatsabahu yamghendele. Naye Adoniya kaghenda kwa mfalume Selemani, kamwinamila. Selemani kamlongela, “Uka ukaye yako.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Usia wa Daudi kwa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Ghamatsuwa gha Daudi gha ukufa haghapfikile habehi, kamkema Selemani, imwanaghe, kamlongela apfino, <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />“Matsuwa ghangu gha ukuhupa muisi ghapfika, ka pfawakufa iwanu wose, apfo ugangamale uwe mmale. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />Tenda aghala ghayokulaghitsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, winza tsinzila tsake, ghakinde ghamalaghitso ghake na imiko yake na malamtsi ghake ka pfaghandikighwe mna ichitabu cha ghamalaghitso cha Musa. Naghwe kutsobweda mna chila chinu chautenda na kokose akula kwaughenda kutsobweda. <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />Ung'atenda apfo, IMNDEWA katsotenda achila chayelaghane na nene, ahala hayalongile, ‘Ka iwatsukulu wako watsokala apfila pfaibaimighwa, na wang'akinda malaghitso ghangu kwa ghumoyo ghwawo ghose, ghweghwe ng'utsokala baye bila kuwa na munu iyatsokalila ichighoda cha ufalume cha Isiraeli.’<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />“Pfipfila ghweghwe komanya ghendo achila chayanitendele Yoabu mwanaghe Seruya, apfila pfayawatendele iwakulu wa ing'ondo weli wa Isiraeli, Abineri mwanaghe Neri, na miyaghe Amasa mwanaghe Yeteli. Kawakoma ka apfila tsakuna ng'ondo. Kawakoma iwanu iwalihela matotso, na kaibakatsa idamu aila mna ghumsipi ighuli mchuno mwake, na mna imikwabatsa iili mna ghamaghulu ghake. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Ghweghwe komanya ichinu cha ukumtendela, uleke kumleka yalale na yafe pfipfino hela. <verse eid="1KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />Lekeni uwe mluso kwa iwana wa Barizilai, Mgileadi na uwaleke waje hamwe naghwe hana imetsa yako, kwaapfila wawo tsawanendela ighanoghile ahala hanimtsumile ndughu yako Abusalomu. <verse eid="1KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />Na ukumbuke ka kuna Shimei mwanaghe Gera, Mbenjamini kulawa Bahurimu, iyandighite kwa malighito makulu ahala hang'endile Mahanaimu. Lekeni hayahulumke yatse yambokele hana ghumto ghwa Yoridani, nene nilaha kwa IMNDEWA, nonga, ‘Sitsokukoma na limaghe baye!’ <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Apfo uleke kumleka pfipfino hela, kwaapfila ghweghwe kukengela, na komanya cha ukumtendela, lidumle litwi lyake lina tsimvi, lilaghale hasi.”<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Kuya Daudi kafa, katsikighwa kuna ghumji ghwake, ighukemighwe Mji ghwa Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Daudi kawa mfalume mna isi ya Isiraeli kwa miyaka alubaini, miyaka saba mna ghumji ghwa Heburoni, na miyaka salasini na midatu mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Selemani kawa mfalume, kachikalila ichighoda cha ufalume cha Daudi aba wake na ufalume wake tsauwa na ngupfu ghendo. <verse eid="1KI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Lelo Adoniya, imwanaghe Hagiti, kaghenda kwa Batisheba, mai wake Selemani. Naye Batisheba kamghutsa, “Angu ukutsa kwako akuno kutsa ghoya?” Adoniya kamwidika, “Ona, nitsa ghoya.” <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Kuya Adoniya kalonga, “Nina mbuli nobama nikulongele.” Batisheba kamwidika, “Longa nokutegheletsa.”<verse eid="1KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Adoniya kamlongela, “Ka pfaumanya, nene ning'awile mfalume, na Waisiraeli wose tsawabama nene niwe mfalume wao. Lekeni ng'aiwile apfo baye, na sambi mdodo wangu kawa mfalume, kwaapfila IMNDEWA mwenyegho yuyo iyabamile yeye yawe mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Lekeni nina chinu chimwe cha ukukulomba, uleke kundemela.” Batisheba kamghutsa, “Chinu chachi?”<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Adoniya kamwidika, “Umlombe mfalume Selemani yangaye Abishagi iyolawa Shunami nimkwele yawe mwehe wangu, kwaapfila yeye ng'atsokulemela baye.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Batisheba kamwidika, “Pfinogha nitsokulongelela kwa mfalume.”<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Apfo Batisheba kaghenda kwa mfalume Selemani kumlongela Adoniya chayolomba. Mfalume kenuka yambokele mai wake, kamwinamila, naye kakala mna ichighoda chake cha ufalume. Kuya kalaghitsa chighalighwe chighoda chingi yakale mai wake, naye kakala ubali wake wa kujilo. <verse eid="1KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Kalonga, “Nina chinu chimwe chidodo cha ukukulomba, uleke kundemela.” Selemani kaghutsa, “Chinu chachi mai? Longa sitsokulemela baye.”<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Apfo mai wake kalonga, “Umleke mkulu wako Adoniya yamkwele Abishagi, Mshunami.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Mfalume Selemani kamghutsa mai wake, “Heule kolomba Abishagi yakwelighwe na Adoniya, pfipfila kutsolomba yeng'ighwe na ufalume, na umanye ghendo ka yeye mkulu wangu, na yeye na mtambika Abiatari, na Yoabu mwanaghe Seruya, wose wadatu lyao limwe.” <verse eid="1KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Baho mfalume Selemani kelighita kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA, kalonga, “Imulungu yandiye ka Adoniya ng'akufa baye kwa ichinu achino chayalombile. <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Apfo lelo, ka IMNDEWA iyali mgima, yeye iyanyikile nyime ghoya na ng'ale mna ichighoda cha aba wangu Daudi, iyatendile chayelaghane na nene chilawile kwa kungaya nene ufalume, na kwa watsukulu wangu, leloli aino nelaha ghendo Adoniya katsakufa.”<verse eid="1KI 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Apfo mfalume Selemani kamlaghitsa Benaya, mwanaghe Yehoyada, kaghenda kamtowa Adoniya mbaka kafa.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoabu kokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Kuya mfalume kamlongela mtambika Abiatari, “Uke kuna mghunda ghwako ighuli Anatoti. Ghweghwe kobamighwa ufe, lekeni sambi sitsokukoma baye, kwaapfila tsakuduta lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA Imulungu hambele ha aba wangu Daudi, na mwihangila wose na aba wangu mna ukudununzika.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Naye mfalume Selemani kamuwinga Abiatari yaleke kuwa mtambika keli wa IMNDEWA, apfo chilawila achila chayalongile IMNDEWA akula Shilo kwa Eli na ilukolo lwake. <verse eid="1KI 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Yoabu hayahulike agho, katsumila kuna iluwa lwa lihema lya IMNDEWA, kakindilisa tsimembe tsa imatsabahu yahone, kwaapfila yeye kamuwinza Adoniya, lekeni tsang'amuwinzile Abusalomu baye. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Naye mfalume Selemani tsakahulika ka Yoabu katsumila kuna iluwa lwa lihema lya IMNDEWA, kema hana imatsabahu. Kuya Selemani kamlaghitsa Benaya, mwanaghe Yehoyada, “Ghenda kamkome!”<verse eid="1KI 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Apfo Benaya kengila mna iluwa lwa lihema lya IMNDEWA, kamlongela Yoabu, Mfalume kolonga apfino, “Ulawe kunze!” Lekeni yeye kamwidika, “Baye nitsakufila baha.” Benaya koya kumlongela mfalume, “Apfi pfipfo Yoabu pfayanyidike nene.”<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Kuya mfalume kamlaghitsa Benaya, “Tenda ka pfayolonga, umkome na umtsike. Apfo nene na lukolo lwose lwa Daudi ng'atutotsa baye kwa achila chayatendile Yoabu kwa kuwakoma iwanu iwalihela matotso. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />IMNDEWA katsomliha Yoabu kwa kuwakoma iwanu awo weli iwanoghile kubita yeye. Kwaapfila aba wangu Daudi ng'amanyile chinu chochose baye kwa ukukomighwa Abineri mwanaghe Neli, mkulu wa lijeshi wa Isiraeli na Amasa mwanaghe Yeteri, mkulu wa lijeshi wa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Apfo idamu yawo itsokala mwitwi mwa Yoabu na lukolo lwake matsuwa ghawo ghose. Lekeni kwa Daudi na ilukolo lwake na ing'anda yake, na ichighoda chake cha ufalume, IMNDEWA katsoweng'a tindiwalo matsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Apfo Benaya mwanaghe Yehoyada, kaghenda kuna iluwa lwa lihema kamkoma Yoabu, naye katsikighwa mna ghumghunda ghwake ighuli kunyika. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Kuya mfalume kamwika Benaya mwanaghe Yehoyada yawe mkulu wa ng'ondo, kasola hanu ha Yoabu, na Sadoki kawa mtambika, kasola hanu ha Abiatari.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimei kokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Kuya mfalume kalaghitsa Shemei yakemighwe, naye hayatsile kamlongela, “Witsengele ng'anda mumno Yerusalemu, ukale mumo wala uleke kughenda kokose. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Litsuwa alila haukuka na kuloka chikolongo cha Kidironi, nokulongela ghendo kutsakufa, naghwe kutsakuwa kwihonza ghumwenyegho.” <verse eid="1KI 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Shimei kamwidika, “Kulonga ghoya mfalume, nitsotenda ka pfaulongile.” Apfo kakala Yerusalemu kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="1KI 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Miyaka midatu haipfosile, watumwa weli wa Shimei watsumila kwa Akishi, mwanaghe Maaka, mfalume wa Gati. Shimei hayahulike ka waghenda Gati, <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />kadina chihongwe wake, kaghenda Gati kwa mfalume Akishi kuwabama, ako kawona na kawoyitsa ukaye. <verse eid="1KI 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Selemani hayahulike ka Shimei kalawa Yerusalemu kaghenda Gati na koya, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />kamkema kamlongela, “Pfihi nene sikulongele baye wilahe hambele ha IMNDEWA, na sikukanyile baye hanongile, ‘Litsuwa alila hautsolawa kunze ya Yerusalemu kutsakufa ghendo?’ Naghwe kunyidika, ‘Chaulonga chinogha. Nitsotenda.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Heule lelo ng'utendile baye achila chawilahile kwa IMNDEWA na ng'ukindile baye achila chanikulaghitse?” <verse eid="1KI 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Mfalume kamlongela keli Shimei, “Ghweghwe komanya ghendo ghose ghehile ghaumtendele aba wangu Daudi. Na Sambi IMNDEWA katsokuyitsila aghala ghehile ghautendile. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Lekeni Imulungu katsonibaliki nene, na ufalume wa Daudi utsakwima ghoya matsuwa ghose hambele ha IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Kuya mfalume kamlaghitsa Benaya mwanaghe Yehoyada, naye kalawa kaghenda kamtowa Shimei na kamkoma. Apfo ufalume wa Selemani wima ghoya.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Selemani kolomba hekima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Selemani keleghana na Farao mfalume wa Misiri yamkwele imwanaghe. Kamghala neghe Farao yakale kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi mbaka hayamalitse kutsenga ing'anda yake ya chifalume, na Ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na ubanda utsunguluka Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho iwanu wang'ali wotambika kuna ipfidanando pfa ukutsengighwa kwaapfila ing'anda ya IMNDEWA tsaing'ali ukutsengighwa. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Selemani tsakamkunda IMNDEWA, kakinda malaghitso ghose gha aba wake Daudi, lekeni tsayang'ali yolapfa nambiko na kudusula ubani mna ipfidanando pfa ukutsengighwa.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Mfalume kaghenda kutambika ako Gibeoni, kwaapfila hanu aho tsahana hanu ha ukutambikila hatsengighwe ihamanyike ng'ani kwa ukutambika. Ako Selemani kalapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa elufu imwe mchanya mwa imatsabahu ayo.<verse eid="1KI 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Kuko Gibeoni, IMNDEWA kamlawila Selemani mndoto nechilo, na Imulungu kalonga, “Unombe chochose achila chaubama nene nikwing'e.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Selemani kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kumtenda uluso mkulu mtumighwa wako, aba wangu Daudi, kwaapfila yeye tsakatogholighwa kuna ghweghwe, tsakanogha kwa Imulungu, na ghumoyo ghwake ghwose tsaghunogha. Naghwe kughendelela kumtendela uluso kwaapfila kumwing'a imwana iyokala mna ichighoda chake cha ufalume ka pfaili leloli aino. <verse eid="1KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />Lelo, ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu, kunyika nene mtumighwa wako niwe mfalume hanu ha aba wangu Daudi, lekeni nene na mwana mdodo na simanyile baye ing'onde ya ukulongotsa pfaili. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Sambi naahano haghati ghati ha iwanu yuwasaghule wawe wanu wako ghendo, nawo wa wengi sideke, ng'awodahika baye kupetighwa kwa apfila pfawali wengi. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Apfo nokulomba ungaye ghumoyo ghwa ukutegheletsa, nidahe kuwalongotsa iwanu wako ghoya na nimanye ighanoghile na ighehile. Kwaapfila nani ghendo iyodaha ukuwalongotsa iwanu wako awano iwali wengi?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Chayalombile Selemani tsachimnoghela IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Apfo Imulungu kamlongela, “Kwaapfila kulomba chinu achino, na ng'ulombile baye ukale matsuwa mengi wala uwe na mali nyingi, wala ng'ulombile baye awala iwokwihila wafe, lekeni ghweghwe kulomba umanye ukulongotsa na ukuhigha pfinoghile. <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />Nitsotenda achila chaulombile, nitsokwing'a ghumoyo ghuna ihekima na ighumanya, na kuduhu wala ng'atsolawila munu wowose baye iyakengele ka ghweghwe. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Pfipfila nitsokwing'a aghala ghang'aulombile baye, kutsakuwa na mali na kutsotegheletsighwa, mna ghamatsuwa ghako ghose ghaukala mgima kutsakuwa kuduhu mfalume iyali ka ghweghwe. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Na ung'awinza nzila tsangu, na kukinda ghamalaghitso ghangu na imiko yangu ka pfayatendile aba wako Daudi, nene nitsokwika ukale matsuwa mengi.”<verse eid="1KI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Kuya Selemani kalamka, baho katanga yang'ali yolota. Kuya koya Yerusalemu, kema habehi na lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA, baho katambika kwa kulapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsa na tsa ukukala tseghamba. Kuya kawatendela chihungo watumighwa wake wose.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani kolamla ghomba kulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Lelo wapinga weli pfiweghe wamghendela mfalume Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Pinga yumwe kalonga, “Mkulu wangu nene na miyangu ayuno twokala ng'anda imwe. Nene nyeleka mwana mmale aku twawose. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Ikacha haipfikile naye keleka mwana. Tsatwaweli tuliyeka mng'anda, tsakuduhu munu yungi. <verse eid="1KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />Nechilo imwanaghe kafa, kwaapfila tsakamuwasila. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Apfo mna ichilo chikulu, kamsola imwanangu, aku nene mtumighwa wako niwasa fofofo, kamuwasitsa hana ghamatombo ghake. Kuya kamsola imwanaghe iyafile kamuwasitsa hana ghamatombo ghangu. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Handamke nemitondo, nibama nimwong'etse imwanangu, baho nitanga kafa. Lekeni nemitondo hakulangale, tsanimlolesa pfinoghile imwana, baho nitanga imwana si wangu yanimweleke baye.”<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Lekeni ipinga ayula yungi kalonga, “Baye imwana mgima yuyo wakwangu, iyafile wakwako.” Ipinga ayula wa kwanza kalonga keli, “Baye, iyafile yuyo wakwako, iyali mgima wakwangu.” Apfo wesonga aho hambele ha mfalume.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Mfalume kalonga, “Ayuno kolonga, ‘Imwanangu mgima na iyafile wakwako,’ yungi kolonga, ‘Baye, imwanagho kafa na imgima wakwangu.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Kuya mfalume kalonga, “Ngalileni limaghe.” Apfo wamghalila limaghe mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Kuya kalaghitsa, “Mbatsuleni imwana ayuno iyali mgima, chipande chimwe mmwing'e ayuno na chingi mmwing'e miyaghe.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Ipinga ayula yana imwana imgima kamwonela libatsi imwanaghe, apfo kamlongela mfalume, “Dedede mfalume, umwing'e yeye imwana ayo iyali mgima, uleke kumkoma!” Lekeni ipinga yungi kalonga, “Baye, imwana yaleke kuwa wake wala wangu. Mganeni pfihande pfili.”<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Baho mfalume Selemani kalonga, “Mleke kumkoma imwana, mwing'eni ipinga wa mwanduso, yeye yuyo mai wake.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Iwanu wose wa Isiraeli hawahulike mfalume pfayalamle lighomba alyo, wampfuka, watanga ghendo ka Imulungu yuyo iyamwing'ile tsimbutsi tsa kuhigha ghoya ghamaghomba.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Pfilongotsi iwamwapfile Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Apfo mfalume Selemani kawa mfalume wa Isiraeli yose, <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />na awano wawo pfilongotsi wake wakulu iyawekile, Azaria mwanaghe Sadoki, imtambika, <verse eid="1KI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Elihorefu na Ahiya, wanaghe Shausha, waandishi; Yehoshafati mwanaghe Ahiludi yang'ali yakwandika tsikumbukumbu; <verse eid="1KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Benaya mwanaghe Yehoyada, yeye tsa mkulu wa maasikali, Sadoki na Abiatari, wawo tsawatambika. <verse eid="1KI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Azaria mwanaghe Natani, yeye tsa mkulu tsa mkulu wa pfilongotsi wose wa tsiisi. Mtambika Zabudi mwanaghe Natani, yeye tsakakala sale wa mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahishari yeye tsa mkulu wa ing'anda ya mfalume, na Adoniramu mwana wa Abda yeye yang'ali yakwimila tsisang'ano tsa ukunanahitsighwa.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Selemani tsakana pfilongotsi kumi na weli mna Isiraeli yose. Wawo wang'ali womghalila ipfijo mfalume na iwanu iwali hakaye yake, chila yumwe tsakaghala chijo cha mwetsi ghumwe mna chila mwaka. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Na aghano ghagho mataghwa ghawo, Beni huri tsachilongotsi mna ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu. <verse eid="1KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Beni Dekeri, tsachilongotsi wa isi tsa Makai, na Shaalbimu, na Bethshemeshi na Elonbetihanani. <verse eid="1KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Beni Hesedi, tsachilongotsi mna ghumji ghwa Aruboti; hamwe na isi ya Soko na isi yose ya Heferi. <verse eid="1KI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Beni Abinadabu, mmale wake Tafati, neghe Selemani, tsakalongotsa isi yose ya Nafati Doli. <verse eid="1KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Na Baana mwanaghe Ahiludi, tsakalongotsa isi ya Taanaki, na Megido, na isi yose ya Beti Sheani ili habehi na ghumji ghwa Zaleti, kusini kwa Yezireeli, kwanzila Beti Shani mbaka Abeli Mehola, mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Yokimeamu. <verse eid="1KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Naye Beni Geberi, tsakalongotsa isi ya Ramoti Gileadi hamwe na imiji ya Gileadi tsaikalile ya Yairi mwanaghe Manase, pfipfila tsakalongotsa isi ya Arigobu ili Bashani, na miji yake ipfikile sitini itsungulusighwe ubanda na ikalile na makomeo gha shaba mna ghamalango. <verse eid="1KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ahinadabu mwanaghe Ido tsakalongotsa mna ghumji ghwa Mahanaimu na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="1KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimaasi tsakalongotsa isi ya Nafutali, yeye tsakamkwela Basemati, neghe Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Baana mwanaghe Hushai tsakalongotsa isi ya Asheri na Beloti. <verse eid="1KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Yehoshafati mwanaghe Parua, yeye tsakalongotsa mna isi ya Isakari. <verse eid="1KI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Shimei mwanaghe Ela tsakalangotsa isi ya Benjamini. <verse eid="1KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Geberi mwanaghe Uri tsakalongotsa isi ya Gieladi, ghumwande tsailaongotsighwa na Sihoni mfalume wa Waamori, na Ogi mfalume wa Bashani. Pfipfila Giberi tsakawa mkulu wa isi ayo yose.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Iwanu wa Yuda na Isiraeli tsawawengi ka msanga ghwa kumwani, na wang'ali wakuja na kunwa na kudeng'a. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Naye Selemani katawala falume tsose kwanzila mto Eufurati, mbaka kuna isi ya Wafilisti, mbaka kuna ghumbaka ghwa isi ya Misiri. Isi tsose atsino tsiliha kodi kwa Selemani na tsimsang'anila yeye matsuwa ghake ghose ghayakalile mgima. <verse eid="1KI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Ipfijo pfa Selemani kwa chila tsuwa tsa madebe miya ndatu na sitini gha utimbo utighinike ghendo, na madebe miya saba na ishililini gha utimbo. <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />Ng'ombe kumi wa ukufughighwa ukaye na ng'ombe ishilini wa ukudimighwa kubagho, na ng'olo miya imwe, hamwe na ayala, na kulungu, na ng'uku iwanonile.<verse eid="1KI 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Naye tsakatawala isi yose ili maghalibi mwa ghumto Eufulati kwanzila Tifsa mbaka Gaza, na kakala tseghamba chila ubali. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Matsuwa ghose ghayatawale Selemani, iwanu wa Yuda na iwanu wa Isiraeli kwanzila Dani mbaka Beeri Sheba tsawakala tseghamba, chila munu kakala hasi ha mitsabibu yake, na hasi ha mibiki yake ya mitini.<verse eid="1KI 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Selemani tsakana pfibanda elufu alubaini pfa ukwika wafalasi iwokwegha imituka yake, na tsakana iwadina falasi elufu kumi na mbili. <verse eid="1KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Iwakulu awala kumi na weli, chila yumwe mna ghumwetsi ghwake kamghalila ichijo mfalume na iwanu wose iwokala ukaye yake. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Pfipfila tsawaghala ishairi, hamwe na imitsani ya ukuja wafalasi iwokwegha imituka, na wafalasi wangi iwosang'ana ng'onde tsingi, waighala hanu hawali wafalasi.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Imulungu tsakamwing'a Selemani hekima na tsimbutsi nyingi, na kamanya pfinu pfingi ka msanga ighuli kumwani. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Selemani tsakana hekima kubita iwanu wose iwokala mashariki na kubita iwanu wose wa Misiri. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Tsakana hekima kubita munu wowose ayula, kambita mbaka Etani, ayula mwezirahi. Pfipfila kawabita Hemani, Kalikoli na Darida iwanaghe Maholi. Ukumanyika kwake tsakwenela mna isi tsose tsimtsunguluke. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Kandika ng'ungo elufu ndatu, na tsiwila tsibitile elufu imwe. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Kalonga mbuli tsa mibiki yose, kwanzila mbiki ghwa mweletsi ighuli Lebanoni, mbaka hisopo ighukota mna ubanda. Pfipfila tsakawamanya wanyama wose, wapfideghe wose, na awala wose iwotambala, na wasomba. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Iwanu kulawa isi tsose wamghendela Selemani kutegheletsa hekima yake, nawo tsawatumighwa na wafalume wa isi tsawo iwahulike ihekima yake.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Selemani kobama kutsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Naye mfalume Hiramu wa Tiro, iyawile sale yake Daudi, hayahulike ka Selemani kabakighwa mapfuta yawe mfalume, kasola hanu ha aba wake, kawatuma watumighwa wake waghende kwa Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Naye Selemani katuma wanu woye kwa Hiramu kumlongela, <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Ghweghwe komanya ghendo ka aba wangu Daudi ng'amtsengele baye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake ing'anda ya ukutambikila, kwaapfila yeye yang'ali yetowa na iwanu wa isi tsingi tsimtsunguluke chila ubali mbaka IMNDEWA hayamwapfile kuwatowa maadui tsake. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Lekeni sambi IMNDEWA kanyapfila, nikala tulu ghendo chila ubali na nahela adui wala maghayo. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Lelo nobama nimtsengele ing'anda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlongele aba wangu Daudi, ahala hayalongile, ‘Imwanagho yanimwika yakalile ichighoda chako cha ufalume, yeye katsonitsengela ing'anda ya ukutambikila.’ <verse eid="1KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />Apfo walaghitse iwanu wako waniganile imibiki ya miyeletsi ya Lebanoni, wanu wangu watsosang'ana hamwe na iwanu wako mna ing'onde ayo, na nene nitsowaliha wanu wako chochose chaubama. Naghwe kwomanya ghendo ka kududu munu mna twetwe iyadahile kugana ghoya imibiki ka Wasidoni.”<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Hiramu hayahulike chayalongile Selemani tsakadeng'elela sideke, kalonga, “IMNDEWA yatunyighwe, kwaapfila kamwing'a Daudi imwana yakengele yawatawale iwanu awano wengi.” <verse eid="1KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Apfo Hiramu katuma wanu kwa Selemani, kalonga, “Nene nihulika achila chaulongile, na nitsotenda ghose ghaubama, nitsoweng'a pfipilighwa pfa miyeletsi na miberoshi. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Iwanu wangu watsopfiduta na kupfihulumsa kulawa Lebanoni mbaka kuna ibahari na nitsopfoha makinzamakinza pfiyeluke mna ghamatsi mbaka pfipfike hanu haubama. Kuko wanu wangu watsopfidohola, naghwe kutsopfibokela, lekeni ghweghwe kutsongaya ichijo kwa iwanu wa ukaye yangu.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Apfo Hiramu kamwing'a pfipilighwa pfose pfa miyeletsi na pfa miberoshi pfayabamile. <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />Naye Selemani kamwing'a Hiramu ingano madebe laki mbili na elufu alubaini, na mapfuta gha mitseituni ghanoghile madebe miya mbili. Selemani tsakamtendela apfo Hiramu chila mwaka.<verse eid="1KI 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />IMNDEWA naye kamwing'a Selemani ihekima ka pfayamlongele. Selemani na Hiramu wakala bila ukwisonga, apfo wose weli weka laghano.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Mfalume Selemani kawasaghula wanu elufu salasini kulawa chila hanu mna isi ya Isiraeli, wasang'ane ng'onde ng'omu tsa kunanahitsighwa, <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />naye kamwika Adoniramu yawemilile. Kawaghola mna makingili madatu, gha wanu elufu kumikumi, nawo wakala mwetsi ghumwe mna isi ya Lebanoni na miyetsi mili wakala ukaye. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Selemani tsakana waduta mitsigho elufu sabini, na wasongola mabwe elufu semanini iwali kupfidunda. <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />Na kaweka wanu elufu ndatu na miya ndatu wawemilile iwanu awo. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Kwa laghitso lya mfalume wabula mabwe makulu gha bei ng'ulu waghasongole, wakatsengele ilukwalambatsa lwa ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Apfi pfipfo iwanu wa Selemani na Hiramu pfawekile ghoya ghamabwe na imibiki ya ukutsengela ing'anda ya Imulungu.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Selemani pfayaitsengile ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Selemani kanza ukutsenga ing'anda ya Imulungu mna ghumwaka ghwa miya nne na semanini kulawa Waisireli hawalawile Misiri. Aghwo tsa mwaka ghwa kane kwa Selemani kutawala mna isi ya Isiraeli, mna mwetsi ghwa keli, ighukemighwe ghumwetsi ghwa Zifu. <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Ing'anda Selemani iyamtsengele IMNDEWA tsaina utali wa futi tisini, na ughatsi wake futi salasini, na kughenda kuchanya futi alubaini na tano. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Na ichikuta cha ing'anda china utali wa futi salasini, ka pfauli ughatsi wa ing'anda, kuya ichikuta acho chilawa kunze hambele ha ing'anda kwa ughatsi wa futi kumi na tano. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Kagheka madilisha mna ing'anda ayo, kunze ghoneka masisili na mghati ghoneka maghatsi. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Mna ubanda wa ing'anda, katsenga pfiheleto ipfitsunguluke ubanda wose, mbaka hanu haenzeluke ng'ani. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Pfiheleto pfili hasi, mna apfila ipfiheleto ipfongetseke, tsapfina utali wa futi saba na nusu, na apfila ipfili uchanya tsapfina utali wa futi tisa, na apfila ipfili uchanya ng'ani tsapfina utali wa futi kumi na nusu. Unene wa ubanda wa hasi tsa mkulu kubita unene wa ubanda wa haghati, nawo tsa mkulu kubita wa ubanda wa uchanya, ili imighamba ileke kwingila mna ubanda wa ing'anda. <verse eid="1KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Ing'anda haing'ali yotsengighwa, kuduhu iyahulike inyundo wala chinu chochose cha chuma chodughighwa, kwaapfila tsaitsengighwa kwa ghamabwe ighasongolighwe kulawa kuko kwaghabulighwe. <verse eid="1KI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Mlango ghwa ing'anda ya hasi ghwikighwa ubali wa kusini wa ing'anda. Mghati katsenga ngatsi ya ukudinila mna ipfiheleto pfa haghati na pfa uchanya. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Apfi pfipfo mfalume Selemani pfayaitsengile ing'anda ya Imulungu. Kaihaghala kwa tsiboliti na mibiki ya miyeletsi. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Katsenga pfiheleto apfo ipfisunguluka ing'anda yose na chila chimwe tsachina chimo cha futi saba na nusu na pfikindighwa na mibiki ya mweletsi kulawa kuna ubanda wa ing'anda. <verse eid="1KI 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Selemani, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />“Kwa ing'anda aino yautsenga, ung'aghakinda ghamalaghiso ghangu na imiko yangu yanikulaghitsa, nitsokutendela achila chanimlongele aba wako Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Nitsokala na Waisiraeli, wala sitsowaleka baye iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli.” <verse eid="1KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Apfo Selemani katsenga ing'anda ayo na kaimalitsa.<verse eid="1KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ing'anda ya Imulungu pfaihambighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Kakutandatsa mghati mwa ubanda kwa mbao tsa miyeletsi kulawa hasi mbaka kuchiswili, apfo kaughubika ubanda awo kwa mibiki, na hasi katandatsa mbao tsa miboreshi. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Ichiheleto cha mghati ichikemighwe Hanu haenzeluke ng'ani, chigholighwa kuchughu mng'anda, na utali wake tsafuti salasini nacho kachitandatsa na mbao tsa miyeletsi kulawa hasi mbaka kuchiswili. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Na ichiguta ichili hambele ha hanu Haenzeluke ng'ani tsachina utali wa futi sitini. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Na mghati mwa ing'anda tsakuna mbao tsa miyeletsi, itsihambighwe pfibuyu na maluwa ighasanule. Chila hanu haghubikighwa na miyeletsi, kuduhu libwe ilyoneke. <verse eid="1KI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Keka ghoya ichiheleto cha ukwikila lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA, ichiheleto chili mmghati ghendo. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Ichiheleto acho chikala na utali wa futi salasini, na ughatsi wake futi salasini, na chimo chake futi salasini, nacho chighubikighwa nzahabu inoghile. Pfipfila kaighubika imatsabau kwa mbao tsa mweletsi. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Selemani kaghubika mghati mwa ing'anda kwa nzahabu inoghile, kaika ilebele imikufi ya nzahabu hambele ha ichiheleto cha mghati, ichikandikighwe nzahabu.,, <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Apfo mghati mwa ing'anda yose kaghubika nzahabu. Pfipfila kaighubika nzahabu imatsabahu ili hanu haenzeluke ng'ani.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Mna ichiheleto chili mghati kahongola kwa mibiki ya mitseituni pfiumbe pfibili wane mabawa iwokemighwa makelubi, chila yumwe tsakana chimo cha futi kumi na tano. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Chila bawa tsalina utali wa futi saba na nusu, apfo tsakuna futi kumi na tano kulawa utsighilo wa bawa limwe mbaka wa libawa lingi. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Ikelubi wa keli pfipfila tsakana utali wa futi kumi na tano, kwaapfila wose awo weli tsaweghala, na tsawana umbo limwe. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Utali wawo kughenda kuchanya tsa futi kumi na tano. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Kaweka makelubi awo mna ichiheto chili hanu haenzeluke ng'ani cha ing'anda ya Imulungu, akuno ghamabawa ghawo ghapamanuka. Na bawa lya kelubi yumwe ligusa ubanda umwe, na libawa lya kelubi yungi ligusa ubanda ungi, akuno ghamabawa ghao ghangi ghegusa haghatighati ha ichiheto. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Kawakandika nzahabu makelubi awo. <verse eid="1KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Ubanda wose utsunguluke ing'anda, mna ichiguta hanu haenzeluke ng'ani kachola makerubi, na mitende na maluwa ighasanule. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Kapfikandika nzahabu hasi ha ipfiheleto pfa mghati na pfa kunze. <verse eid="1KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Haukwingilila mna ichiheleto cha mghati, kahongola milango ya mibiki ya mitseituni, na pfitsingiti na miimo ikala ya umbo lya membe tano. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Na mna imilango ayo mili ya mitseituni kasongola makelubi, na mitende, na maluwa ghasanule, na imicholo ayo kaikandika nzahabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Pfipfila kasongola lilango lya mbiki ghwa mtsetuni lya membe nne lya ukwingilila hachikuta. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Tsakuna milango mili ya kupfeduka ya mbiki ghwa mboreshi, chila ghumwe tsaghuna bawaba itsitenda ghupfeduke. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Mna imilango ayo, kasongola makelubi, na mitende, na maluwa ighosanula, na kaikandika nzahabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Katsenga uwa wa mghati hambele ha ing'anda ya Imulungu, na ubanda wake utsungulutsighwa wa ghamabwe ugholeka mala ndatu, na mchanya mwa ghamabwe agho keka mibiki ya miyeletsi. <verse eid="1KI 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Ghumsingi ghwa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ghutsengighwa mna ghumwetsi ghwa keli, ighukemighwe ghumwetsi ghwa Zifu, mna ghumwaka ghwa kane ghwa utawala wa Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Mna ghumwetsi ghwa nane, ighukemighwa ghumwetsi ghwa Buli, mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na moja, ing'anda tsaimalitsika kutsengighwa, ka apfila mfalume Selemani pfayabamile ukutsenga. Selemani kaitsenga ing'anda ayo kwa miyaka saba.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s">Ing'anda ya chifalume ya Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Selemani kamalitsa ukuitsenga ing'anda yake ya chifalume kwa miyaka kumi na midatu. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Kaitsenga ing'anda ayo ya chifalume ikemighwe Ng'anda ya Mhulo ghwa Lebanoni, utali wake tsauna futi miya na hamsini, na ughatsi wake futi sabini na tano, na chimo chake futi alubaini na tano, na itsengighwa kwa misululo mine ya ngutso tsa mweletsi, aku mighamba ya mweletsi iwasitsighwa mchanya mwake. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Na ihaghalighwa na mighamba ya mibiki ya mweletsi iwasile mchanya mwa ngutso alubaini na tano, chila msululo mighamba kumi na tano. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Mna chila ubanda tsakuna misululo midatu ya madilisha ighang'ali ghelolesa. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Imilango na ghamadilisha yose tsaina membe nne, na imisululo midatu ya ghamadilisha mna chila ubanda tsaikala yelolesa. <verse eid="1KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Tsakatsenga chikuta cha ngutso, china utali wa futi sabini na tano, na ughatsi wake futi alubaini na tano. Kuya hambele ha ichikuta achino katsenga chibalatsa ichilawilile, na mchanya mwa tsingutso katsenga chiswili. <verse eid="1KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Selemani pfipfila katsenga chikuta cha chighoda cha ufalume, chayahighile ghamaghomba gha iwanu. Kachikema Chikuta cha Kuhighila. Kachitandatsa mibiki ya miyeletsi kulawa hasi mbaka mkano.<verse eid="1KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Na ing'anda yake ya ukukala imwenyegho ikalile kunzingo mwa ichikuta cha ukuhighila tsaitsengighwa ka pfaitsengighwe ing'anda ayo. Kuya Selemani katsenga ng'anda ingi ighalile na ichikuta acho iwe ya neghe Farao mfalume wa Misiri, iyamkwelile.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Tsing'anda tsose atso tsitsengighwa kwa mabwe gha bei ng'ulu kulawa hasi hana ghumsingi mbaka uchanya, na kunze pfipfila mbaka kuna ichibwalu. Na ghamabwe agho ghasongolighwa, na ghaganighwa kwa msumeno kwa kunze na kwa mghati. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Ghumsingi ghutsengighwa kwa mabwe makulu ighanoghile ghana utali wa futi kumi na tano, na ghangi gha futi kumi na mbili. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Mchanya mwake keka mabwe gha bei ng'ulu, kwa pfipimo ipfibamighwa, kuya keka mibiki ya miyeletsi. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Na uwa mkulu utsungulukighwa na ubanda iukalile una misululo midatu ya mabwe ighasongolighwe, na msululo ghumwe ghwa imighamba ya miyeletsi, ka pfachili ichikuta cha mghati cha ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na ka pfachili ichikuta cha ing'anda ayo.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'ano ya Huramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Kuya mfalume Selemani kamkema Huramu kulawa Tiro. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />Ayo mai wake tsa chitsuka kulawa kabila lya Nafutali, na aba wake yang'ali yokala Tiro, na ing'onde ya ayo aba wake tsa ya kulubula na kufina shaba. Huramu tsakakengela sideke na tsakana mbutsi nyingi, kakubuhu mna chila ng'onde ya shaba. Katsa kwa mfalume Selemani, kamsang'anila ng'onde tsake tsose.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsingutso mbili tsa shaba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Huramu katengenetsa ngutso mbili tsa shaba, chila imwe chimo chake tsa futi ishilini na saba, na mtsunguluko ghwake futi kumi na nane. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Pfipfila kafina matwi meli kulawa mna ishaba ilubulighwe, kagheka mchanya mwa tsingutso atso. Chila litwi chimo chake tsa futi saba na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Pfipfila katawa nyapfu mbili tsa unzolingo kwa mikufu iyaifumile, katsika mchanya mwa ghamatwi agho, chila nyapfu mikufi saba. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Kulawa mna ishaba ilubulighwe, kafina pfinu ipfoneke ka matunda gha makomamanga ighakalile mna misululo mili itsunguluka chila nyapfu ya unzolingo iuli mchanya mwa ghamatwi agho. Katenda pfipfo kwa chila ngutso.<verse eid="1KI 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Ghamatwi agho ighali mchanya mwa tsingutso hambele ha ichikuta, tsaghana umbo lya maluwa ighakota mmatsi, ighokemighwa mayungiyungi, ghana chimo cha futi sita. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Mchanya mwa ghamatwi gha tsingutso atso mbili, hanu ihatutumke ka bakuli, habehi na tsinyapfu atsila, tsahana makomamanga aghala miya mbili ighatsunguluke mna misululo mili.<verse eid="1KI 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Huramu katsisimika tsingutso atso tsa shaba hambele ha hanu haukwingilila kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu. Ingutso isimikighwe ghumoko ghwa kujilo kaikema Yakini, na aila isimikighwe ghumoko ghwa kumoso kaikema Boazi. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Ghamatwi gha tsingutso atso tsaghana umbo lya maluwa ighakota mmatsi ighokemighwa mayungiyungi. Apfo ing'onde ya ukutengenetsa tsingutso imala.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libigha kulu lya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Huramu kalubula shaba kafina bigha kulu ghendo ilikemighwe Bahari. Utali wake kughenda hasi libigha alyo tsa futi saba na nusu, na utali wake mwambu na mwambu tsa futi kumi na tano, na mtsunguluko ghwake futi alubaini na tano. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Hasi ha ukingo wa libigha tsakuna pfibuyu ipfifinighwe kulawa ishaba ilubulighwe, tsa pfifinighwa mna misululo mili mtsunguluko, chila futi imwe tsahana pfibuyu saba. Ipfibuyu apfo pfifinighwa hamwe na libigha alyo. <verse eid="1KI 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Libigha alyo likighwa mchanya mwa pfinyagho pfa ng'ombe wamale kumi na weli wa shaba, wadatu walola kasikazini, wadatu walola kusini, wadatu walola mashariki na wadatu walola maghalibi, aku ipfighudi pfao pfilibapa libigha alyo. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Unene wake tsa nchi ndatu, na mna ukingo wake libigha lighala na chikombe, ka luwa lya yungiyungi, na ling'ali likwingila lita ka elufu alubaini tsa matsi.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matololi gha shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Pfipfila kafina matololi kumi gha shaba, chila tololi limwe tsa lina utali wa futi sita, na ughatsi wake futi sita, na chimo chake futi nne na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Na matololi agho tsaghatengenetsighwa apfino, tsakuna mabamba gha mmbali ighakindighwe na ngutso. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Mna ghamabamba agho tsakuna pfinyagho pfa simba, ng'ombe na makerubi, na uchanya kwao, na hasi hao weka unzolingo utawighwe pfinoghile. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Chila tololi tsalina mataili mane gha shaba, na machuma gha shaba ighotsungulusa ghamataili agho, na ngutso tsake nne itsihulumka, ngutso imwe kulawa chila ubali wa litololi kukindilisa ghamachuma agho. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Mlomo ghwa chila tololi kulawa mghati mbaka uchanya tsa futi imwe na nusu. Ghumlomo agho tsaghuna mtsunguluko ghwa futi mbili na lobo. Kuya mchanya mwa ghumlomo tsamna mabamba gha mlaba, nagho tsaghakala si gha mtsunguluko baye. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Na mataili agho mane tsaghakala hasi ha ghamabamba agho, na ghamachuma aghala ghakutsungulusila ghamataili ghalumbitsighwa na litololi. Ichimo cha chila taili tsa futi mbili na lobo. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Ghamataili ghake tsagheghala na mataili gha imituka ya ng'ondo ya ukukweghighwa na falasi. Machuma ghake, rimu tsake, habu tsake, na spoku tsake, pfose tsa pfa shaba. <verse eid="1KI 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Tsakuna maghulu mane mna tsimembe tsa chila tololi, ghamaghulu agho tsa gha chinu chimwe na litololi alyo. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Mchanya mwa chila tololi tsakuna ringi kulu lya shaba lya mtsunguluko, chimo chake nchi tisa. Ghamaghulu na ghamabamba ghalumbighwa mchanya mwa litololi. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Keka makerubi, simba na mibiki ya mitende mna ghamaghulu na ghamabamba, na chila hanu ihoneke hamwatsi, na keka unzolingo chila ubali. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Apfi pfipo pfayaghatengenetse ghamatololi agho kumi, na ghamatololi ghose tsagheghala ghendo kwa chila chinu.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Huramu katengenetsa matangi kumi gha shaba, tangi limwe kwa chila tololi. Chila limwe lisola lita ka miya nane na semanini, na utali wake tsa futi sita. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Keka matololi matano ubali wa kujilo, na matano ghangi kagheka ubali wa kumoso wa ing'anda ya Imulungu. Na libigha alila ilikemighwe Bahari kalika ubali wa kujilo, kuna imembe ya kusini mashariki ya ing'anda ya Imulungu.<verse eid="1KI 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipfinu pfa ing'anda ya Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Pfipfila katengenetsa mabigha, makoleo, na mabakuli gha kughidila. Apfi pfipfo Huramu pfayamalitse tsing'onde tsotse tsa ing'anda ya Imulungu tsayeng'ighwe na mfalume Selemani yatende: <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />tsingutso atsila mbili, ghamatwi meli ighali ka bakuli mchanya mwa tsingutso, na tsinyapfu mbili tsa ukuhamba ghamatwi agho meli ighali mchanya mwa tsingutso, <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />ipfinu ipfoneke ka makomamanga miya nne mna imisululo mili mna chila inyapfu imwe, ikighwe mchanya mwa ghamatwi ighali mchanya mwa tsingutso atso. <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />Pfipfila katengenetsa matololi kumi, na matangi ghake kumi, <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />na libigha alila likulu lya shaba ilikemighwe Bahari, limile mchanya mwa ipfighudi pfa ipfinyagho pfa ng'ombe wamale kumi na weli, iwalibapile libigha alyo. <verse eid="1KI 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />Kuya kafina mabigha, makoleo na mabakuli. Ipfinu pfose apfino ipfili mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Huramu pfayamtengenetsele Selemani, tsa pfa shaba ikuwighwe. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Mfalume kalaghitsa ipfinu apfo pfifinighwe kuna lidongo lya widi mna ichiwala cha Yoridani, haghati ha Sukoti na Saretani. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Selemani ng'apfilingile baye utito wake ipfinu pfose apfino kwaapfila tsa pfingi ng'ani, apfo utito wa ishaba ng'aumanyike baye. <verse eid="1KI 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Pfipfila Selemani kafina pfinu pfa nzahabu pfiwe pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, kafina matsabahu ya nzahabu, imetsa ya nzahabu ya ukwikila ipfighate ipfienzeluke, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />pfigutso pfa nzahabu inoghile pfa ukwikila ipfitasa, kapfika pfitano ubali wa kumoso, na pfitano pfingi kapfika ubali wa kujilo hambele ha hanu haenzeluke ng'ani, maluwa, tsitala, na mikasi, apfo pfose tsa pfa nzahabu. <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />Pfipfila kafina pfikombe, mikasi ya ukudumlila utambi wa tsitala, mabakuli makulu, mabakuli madodo, masiniya gha ukudusulila upfumba, pfihali pfa ukuhalila ghumoto, apfo pfose pfitengenetsighwa kwa nzahabu, bawaba tsa imilango, tsa ghumlango ghwa hanu haenzeluke ng'ani, na bawaba tsa ghumlango ghwa ichikuta cha ing'anda ya Imulungu, apfo pfose tsa pfa nzahabu.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Mfalume Selemani hayamalitse tsing'onde tsose tsa ukuitsenga ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, kapfighala ipfinu apfila aba wake Daudi pfayapfilapfile kwa IMNDEWA. Ipfinu apfo tsa fetsa, nzahabu, na pfinu pfingi, na kapfika hana ichiheleto cha ukwila ipfinu mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lya laghano lyoghalighwa kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Apfo mfalume Selemani kawakema wanzehe wose wa Isiraeli na pfilongotsi wose wa ghamakabila, na iwakulu wa tsikolo waghende Yerusalemu kwayokala yeye, wakalisole lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA kulawa Sayuni, Ghumji ghwa Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wetingana kwa mfalume Selemani mna ghumsimu ghwa ichihungo, mna ghumwetsi ghwa Saba, ighumanyika ghumwetsi ghwa Etanimu. <verse eid="1KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Iwanzehe wose wa Isiraeli hawapfikile, iwatambika wetwika lisanduku, <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />walighala kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu. Walawi na iwatambika pfipfila walighala lihema lya ukwitinganila na ipfinu pfose ipfenzeluke. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Mfalume Selemani na iwanu wose iwetingane naye hambele ha lisanduku, nawo watambika kwa kuchinja ng'olo na ng'ombe wengi ing'awodahika kupeteka baye. <verse eid="1KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Kuya watambika walingitsa lisanduku alila hanu hake, mna ichiheleto cha mghati mwa ng'anda ya Imulungu, Hanu haenzeluke ng'ani, hasi ha ghamabawa gha ipfinyagho pfa ghamakerubi. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Makerubi tsawagholosa mabawa ghao hanu halikalile lisanduku na walighubika lisanduku alyo na mibiki yake ya ukulidutila tsa ya hasi ha ghamabawa. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Imibiki ayo tsamitali ng'ani, na tsayoneka kulawa hanu ahala haenzeluke, na si kulawa hanu hohose baye, na mibiki ayo yabaho mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Tsakuduhu chinu mna lisanduku alila ila tsakuna ghamabamba meli gha ghamabwe ghayekile Musa akula Horebu, ahala IMNDEWA hayekile lilaghano na Waisiraeli hawalawile Misiri. <verse eid="1KI 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Iwatambika hawang'ali wakuka kulawa hanu haenzeluke, baho ing'anda ya IMNDEWA imema bingu. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Libingu alyo liwatenda iwatambika waleke kusang'ana ng'onde yawo, kwaapfila utunitso wa IMNDEWA tsaumema mna ing'anda yake. <verse eid="1KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Baho Selemani kalonga, “IMNDEWA tsakalonga katsokala mna chisi chikulu. <verse eid="1KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Nikutsengela ng'anda ng'ulu na inoghile ghendo iwe hanu hako ha ukukala matsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani kolonga na iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Iwanu wose wa Isiraeli hawemile baho, mfalume Selemani kahunduka, kawabaliki. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />Kuya kalonga, “Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA Imulungu wa Isiraeli, kwaapfila kwa ngupfu yake kachitenda chilawile achila chayalongile kwa mlomo ghwake na aba wangu Daudi, ahala hayalongile <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />‘Kulawa matsuwa aghala ghaniwalapfile Misiri iwanu wangu wa Israeli sina nisaghule mji ghoghose baye mna isi yose ya Isiraeli itsengighwe ing'anda ya Imulungu, iwanu wangu wanitambikileghe mumo, lekeni nimsaghula Daudi yawalongotse iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />“Aba wangu Daudi tsakabama ghendo mmoyo mwake kumtsengela ing'anda ya ukumtambikila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kamlongela aba wangu Daudi, ‘Kwaapfila ichinu cha ukunitsengela nene ing'anda tsa cha mmoyo mwako, pfinogha kwa kubama ukutenda apfo. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Lekeni si ghweghwe baye yutsoitsenga, iyatsoitsenga ing'anda ayo imwanagho, imwana yutsomweleka ghumwenyegho.’<verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />“Na sambi chayalongile IMNDEWA chilawila, nene niwa mfalume hanu ha aba wangu Daudi, na sambi nokalila ichighoda cha ufalume cha Isiraeli, ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile, na nene nimtsengela ing'anda ya ukumtambikila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Kuya nibaghula hanu ha ukukala lisanduku lya lilaghano, mghati mwake mna lilaghano lyayekile IMNDEWA na iwahenga wetu ahala hayawalapfile mna isi ya Misiri.”<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani kolomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Kuya Selemani kema habehi na imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA akuno Waisiraeli wose womlolesa, kagholosa ghamoko ghake kulanga, <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />kalonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA Mulungu wa Isiraeli, kuduhu Mulungu ka ghweghwe kuchanya kulanga wala hasi muisi, ghweghwe yautenda laghano lyaukwika lilawile, na yauwatendela ighanoghile iwatumighwa wako iwokala wokutegheletsa ghweghwe kwa mimoyo yawo yose. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Kumtendela imtumighwa wako Daudi, aba wangu achila chamwilaghane, ona, kwa ghumlomo ghwako kulonga, na kwa ghumoko ghwako ghuna ingupfu chila chinu chaulongile chilawila leloli. <verse eid="1KI 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />Lelo, ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, nokulomba pfipfila ughatende ghalawile aghala ghamwilaghane na aba wangu Daudi ahala haumlongele, ‘Ng'utsokala baye aku kwahela mtsukulu yumwe iyatsokalila ichighoda cha ufalume cha Isiraeli, ka iwatsukulu wako wang'alangitsa mna chila chawotenda, ka ghweghwe pfautendile.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Lelo, ghwe Imulungu wa Israeli, nokulomba ughatende ghalawile ghose aghala ghamwilaghane na imtumighwa wako Daudi, aba wangu.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />“Lekeni ghwe Imulungu, angu kutsokala ghendo muisi? Lola, kulanga kwenyegho, na hata kulanga kuli kuchanya ng'ani ng'akukwenela baye, lelo utsokalatse mna ing'anda aino ndodo yanitsengile? <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Lekeni ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu, tegheletsa chanikulomba na chanikudedetsa, nene imtumighwa wako nokulomba. Utegheletse chanikulilila na chanikulomba mtumighwa wako leloli aino. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Nenge tsako tsiilolese ing'anda aino chilo na misi, hanu ahano ghweghwe haulongile, ‘Taghwa lyangu litsokala hanu ahano, iwanu wanitambikile,’ unitegheletse hanilomba aku nololesa hanu ahano. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Tegheletsa ghanikulomba nene imtumighwa wako, na gha iwanu wako wa Isiraeli hawolomba aku wololesa hanu ahano. Tegheletsa ghatukulomba kulawa kuko kulanga, kwaukala, naghwe ung'ahulika utuleghesile matotso ghetu.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />“Munu yang'amtendela miyaghe ighehile, naye yang'aghalighwa yelahe hambele ha imatsabahu yako ili mng'anda amno, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />chonde, tegheletsa kulawa ako kulanga, uwahighe watumighwa wako. Ayula yumwona katotsa, umuhighe kwa ukulola achila chayatotsile, na ayula iyalihela totso umlekelele, na umghweke kwa ukulola ukutogholighwa kwake.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />“Ka iwanu wako Waisiraeli watowighwa na aduwi tsawo, kwaapfila wakutendela nzambi, na wang'akuyila keli ghweghwe na kulitunya taghwa lyako, akuno wokulomba na wokudedetsa mna ing'anda aino, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />ghweghwe uwategheletse kulawa ako kulanga, ughalekelele ghose aghala ighehile ghawatendile iwanu wako Isiraeli, na uwoyitse mna isi yuweng'ile iwahenga wawo.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />“Ka kulanga kudiwighwa na imvula ng'aitowa baye kwaapfila iwanu wako wakutendela ighehile, na hawolomba akuno wololesa hanu ahano, na kulitunya taghwa lyako, na wotoghola kuleka tsinzambi tsawo, kwaapfila tsakuwadununza, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />uwahulike kulawa ako kulanga, utsilekelele tsinzambi tsawakutendele watumighwa wako, iwanu wako Waisiraeli, na uwafunde ukutenda ighanoghile na uwaghalile imvula itowe mna isi yuweng'ile iwanu wako iwe yawo.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />“Ka kuna nzala muisi, au tauni, au chiyangayanga, au ng'ungu, au ipfijo pfohinyighwa na nzighe, au lung'wawa, au ka iwanu wako wengilighwa na aduwi mna ghumji ghwawo ghwoghwose, au maghayo, au utamu haulawila, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />nokudedetsa wategheletse chawokulomba iwanu wako Waisiraeli. Chila munu yang'atsa na maghayo ghake ighali mmoyo, yang'akulomba akuno kogholosa ghamoko ghake ghalole kuna ing'anda aino, <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />mtegheletse kulawa ako kulanga, kwaukala. Walekelele na uwapfile, mtendele chila munu kwa ukulola achila chayatendile, kwaapfila ghweghwe kwayeka yumanya chili mmoyo mwa iwanu wose, <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />ili wakupfuke ghweghwe matsuwa ghose ghawokala mna isi yuweng'ile iwahenga wetu.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />“Pfipfila kwa imgheni iyali si Muisiraeli baye, iyatsile kulawa isi ya kutali kwaapfila kahulika litaghwa lyako, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />naye yang'abama kukutambikila na kukulomba aku kololesa kuna ing'anda aino, kwaapfila iwanu watsohulika taghwa lyako na pfinu pfikulu pfautendile kwa iwanu wako, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />chonde chonde, mtegheletse chayokulomba kulawa kuko kulanga kwaukala, na mtendele chochose chayokulomba imgheni ayo, ili iwanu wose iwali muisi mwose walimanye taghwa lyako na wakupfuke ghweghwe, ka pfawotenda iwanu wako Waisiraeli. Kuya watsomanya ghendo ka ing'anda aino yanitsengile, itsengighwa ikemighwe kwa taghwa lyako.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />“Iwanu wako wang'aghenda kung'ondo ukwitowa na maadui tsawo, hohose ahala hautsowaghala, na hawatsokulomba ghweghwe IMNDEWA, akuno woghulolesa ghumji aghuno ghwaughusaghule, na ing'anda aino yanikutsengele, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />wahulike kulawa kuko kulanga chawokulomba na chawobama, naghwe uwapfile wahume.<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />“Ka watsokutendela nzambi, kwaapfila kuduhu munu ing'ayotenda nzambi, naghwe ung'aghudubuka na kuwaleka watowighwe na aduwi tsawo, nawo wowasola na wowaghala mna isi ya kutali au ya habehi, <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />nawo mmoyo mwao wang'atanga ka watotsa mna isi ayo ya aduwi tsawo kwawaghalighwe, na wang'atoghola na kukulomba mna isi ya awala iwawaghoghile, wang'alonga ‘Tutenda nzambi, tutotsa, na tukutendela ghehile,’ <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />nawo wang'akuyila kwa mimoyo yawo yose mna isi ya aduwi tsawo iwawaghoghile, na wang'alomba akuno wololesa kuna isi yao, yuweng'ile sekulu tsawo, na kuna ghumji ghwaghusaghule, na kuna ing'anda yanikutsengele, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />wahulike kulawa kuko kulanga kwaukala, chawokulomba na ghawobama, na uwonele libatsi. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Walelekele iwanu wako iwakutendele ighehile, uwaleghusile tsinzambi tsawakutendele, na uwatende iwanu iwawaghoghile wawonele libatsi, <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />kwaapfila wawo wawanu wako, wa kwako ghendo, yuwalapfile Misiri, mna litanuli lya ukulubulila ichuma.<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />“Tsinenge tsako tsiloleseghe achila chayolomba imtumighwa wako, na chawolomba iwanu wako wa Isiraeli, naghwe uwategheletse chila hawokulilila. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe tsakuwabaghula kulawa mna iwanu wa tsiisi tsingi, wawe wanu wako ghendo, ka pfauwalongele kubitila imtumighwa wako Musa, ahala ghwe IMNDEWA hauwalapfile wahenga wetu mna isi ya Misiri.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani kowabaliki iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Selemani hayamalitse ukulomba kwa IMNDEWA, kenuka hana imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA, hanu hayatowile magoti, akuno ghamoko ghake kagholosa kulanga. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Kema, kawabaliki Waisireli wose iwetingane aho, kuya kalonga kwa ukukemelela, <verse eid="1KI 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />“Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA, iyawatendile iwanu wake wa Isiraeli wabwihile, ka pfayalongile. Kuduhu hata chinu chimwe chayalekile ukutenda mna ghose ghanoghile ghayamlongele imtumighwa wake Musa. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, yakale na twetwe, ka pfayakalile na iwahenga wetu, yaleke kutuleka wala kutwasa. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Yeye yaitende imimoyo yetu imloleghe yeye, twang'e mna tsinzila tsake aku twokinda ghamalaghitso na imiko yake na ghamalamtsi ghake ghayaweng'ile iwahenga wetu. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Na ghamalonga ghangu ghanilombile hambele ha IMNDEWA, ghakale habehi na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, chilo na misi, naye yanyapfile nene imtumighwa wake na iwanu wake Waisraeli kwa kuweng'a aghala ghawobama chila tsuwa. <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />Apfo iwanu wose iwali muisi watsomanya ka IMNDEWA yuyo Imulungu, wala kuduhu yungi keli. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Namwe imimoyo yenu imloleghe yeye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, mkale kwa kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghake na imiko yake, ka pfamtenda leloli aino.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ing'anda yakwikighwa kwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Kuya mfalume Selemani na Waisiraeli wose iwakalile aho wamlapfila nambiko IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Naye Selemani kamlapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba, ng'ombe elufu ishilini na mbili na ng'olo laki imwe na ishilini. Apfi pfipfo imfalume na Waisiraeli wose pfawaikile ing'anda iwe ya IMNDEWA Imulungu.<verse eid="1KI 8:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Tsuwa lilyo mfalume kachitenda chele ichibwalu ichili hambele ha ing'anda ya Imulungu, na baho yeye kalapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, na tsa pfijo, na tsa ukukala tseghamba. Katenda apfo kwaapfila imatsabahu ya shaba ikalile hambele ha IMNDEWA tsandodo, ukwenela tsinambiko tsose atso.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Apfo Selemani katenda chihungo, na kukala mtingano mkulu ghwa Waisiraeli wose na yeye, iwanu tsawalawa Lebo Hamati mbaka hana ilukolongo lwa Misiri. Wadeng'elela ichihungo acho hambele ha IMNDEWA kwa matsuwa saba, na matsuwa saba ghangi, apfo watenda ichihungo acho kwa majuma meli. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Ilupfi yake Selemani kawalekelela iwanu woke. Nawo wamlombela tsibalaka mfalume, na woka mmakaye mwao akuno wodeng'elela na kusangalamka mna imimoyo yawo kwa ghose ighanoghile IMNDEWA ghayamtendele imtumighwa wake Daudi na iwanu wake Waisiraeli.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s">IMNDEWA komlawila Selemani lwakeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Selemani hayamalitse ukutsenga ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na ing'anda yake ya chifalume na chila chinu chayabamile ukutenda, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />IMNDEWA kamlawila lwa keli ka pfayamlawile akula Gibeoni. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Nihulika ghose ghaunilombile na ghaubama, niitenda ing'anda aino yaunitsengele ienzeluke, kwa kulika taghwa lyangu likale amwo matsuwa ghose. Nenge tsangu na ghumoyo ghwangu pfitsakuwa baho hana ing'anda aino matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="1KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />Naghwe ung'awinza nzila tsangu kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghwose na kunitoghola nene ka aba wako Daudi pfayatendile, na kukinda malaghitso ghangu na imiko yangu yose na ghamalamtsi ghangu, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />nene nitsochitenda ichighoda chako cha ufalume chime ghendo mna Isiraeli yose ka pfatwilaghane na aba wako Daudi ahala hanongile, ‘Ng'utsokala hela baye bila kuwa na mtsukulu yumwe iyatsokalila ichighoda cha ufalume cha Isiraeli.’ <verse eid="1KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />Lekeni ghweghwe au wanagho wang'aleka kuniwinza na kukinda malaghitso ghangu ghanikwing'ile, na mng'aghenda kuisang'anila milungu ingi, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />nitsowawinga Waisiraeli woke mna isi yaniweng'ile na nitsoilema ing'anda aino yaniitendile yenzeluke likale taghwa lyangu. Baho iwanu wa Isiraeli watsakuwa chinu cha kubetsighwa na kusekighwa na iwanu wose wa isi tsingi. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Hata ka ing'anda aino inogha apfino, lekeni chila munu iyobita ahano katsakwiduka na katsoibetsa na kulonga, ‘Heule IMNDEWA kaitenda apfino isi aino na ing'anda aino?’ <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Nawo wanu watsakwidika, wolonga, ‘Kwaapfila wamleka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo, iyawalapfile wahenga wawo Misiri, welapfa kwa milungu ingi, waitambikila na waisang'anila, apfo IMNDEWA kawaghalila ghamaghayo aghano ghose.’”<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsing'onde tsingi tsa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Haimalile miyaka ishilini, imiyaka ya Selemani ukutsenga ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na ing'anda yake ya chifalume, <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />mfalume Selemani kamwing'a Hiramu mfalume wa Tiro miji ishilini mna isi ya Galilaya, kwaapfila Hiramu tsakamwing'a mibiki ya miyeletsi na miberoshi na inzahabu iyabamile. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Naye Hiramu kaghenda kuilola imiji ayo Selemani iyamwing'ile, lekeni ng'aimnoghele baye. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Apfo Hiramu kamghutsa Selemani, “Miyangu, angu aino miji yachi yungayile?” Apfi pfipfo imiji ayo pfaikemighwa isi ya Kabuli mbaka leloli aino, kwaapfila tsa si chinu ghendo baye. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Hiramu kamghalila Selemani nzahabu kilo ka elufu nne.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipfinu pfingi pfayatendile Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Na apfino pfipfo mfalume Selemani pfayekile tsing'onde tsa ukunanahitsa mna ukutsenga ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na ng'anda yake ya chifalume, na kusindilila ingema ya Milo, na ukutsenga ubanda iutsunguluka ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, na imiji ya Hazori, na Megido, na Gezeri. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Ghumji ghwa Gezeri tsaghubokighwa na mfalume Farao wa Misiri, na kaghulakatsa na moto, kawakoma Wakanani iwakalile mna ghumji agho, kuya kamghweka neghe wake, iyakwelighwe na Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Selemani kaghutsenga keli ghumji agho. Pfipfila kaitsenga Beti Horoni ili kuhisi, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />na Baalati, na Tamari, ghumji ighuli mnyika mwa isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />Katsenga imiji ya ukwikila ipfinu pfake, na ya ukwikila imituka yake, na imiji ya ukukala wafalasi na iwadina falasi. Pfipfila katsenga chila chinu chayabamile yatsenge, ako Yerusalemu, au ako Lebanoni, au mna isi yose iyailongotse. <verse eid="1KI 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Iwanu wose iwalekighwe wagima mna Waamori na Wahiti na Waperizi na Wahivi, na Wayebusi, iwali si Waisiraeli baye, <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />hamwe na iwana wawo ing'awakomighwe na Waisiraeli, awo Selemani kawananahitsa wasang'ane ngonde ng'omu mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Selemani ng'amtendile baye Muisiraeli wowose yawe mtumwa, lekeni wawo tsawawa wanu wake wa ing'ondo, wawa pfilongotsi wake na wakulu wake wa ing'ondo na wa imituka yake na iwadina falasi wake. <verse eid="1KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Awano tsa wawo pfilongotsi mna tsisang'ano tsa ukunanahitsa iwemilile sang'ano tsa Selemani tsa ukutsenga, wakulu miya tano na hamsini wang'ali wowemilila iwanu iwang'ali iwosang'ana.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Neghe Farao hayokile kulawa mna ghumji ghwa Daudi na kughenda kukala mna ing'anda ya chifalume iyamtsengele Selemani, baho Selemani kaisindilila ingema ya Milo. <verse eid="1KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Mala ndatu chila mwaka Selemani yang'ali yolapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba mchanya mwa imatsabahu iyamtsengele IMNDEWA, aku kodusula mafumba hamwe na nambiko atso. Apfo pfipfo pfayaimalitse ing'anda.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Pfipfila mfalume Selemani tsakatsenga tsimelikebu ako Esioni Gebeli, uli habehi na Eloti mmbalimbali mwa Bahari ya Shamu ili muisi mwa Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Naye mfalume Hiramu katuma wanu wake iwamanyile tsisang'ano tsa ibahari wasang'ane hamwe na iwanu wake Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Nawo waghenda mna isi ya Ofiri, kulawa kuko wasola nzahabu kilo elufu kumi na nne wamghalila mfalume Selemani.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Malikia wa Sheba komwangila Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Malikia wa Sheba hayahulike mbuli tsa Selemani na usale wake na IMNDEWA, kamghendela Selemani yakamghutse mbuli ng'omu. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Naye kapfika Yerusalemu aku kelongotsa na wanu wengi, ngamia iwadutile mapfuta ighonung'ila ghoya, nzahabu nyingi, na mabwe gha bei ng'ulu. Na hayapfikile kwa Selemani, kalonga naye ghose ighali mmoyo mwake. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Naye Selemani kamwidika ghose ghayamghutsile, tsakuduhu mbuli ng'omu iyalekile kuyidika ghoya. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Malikia wa Sheba hayonile ihekima ya Selemani na ing'anda ya chifalume iyaitsengile, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />na ichijo ichikighwe mmetsa mwake, na iwakulu wake pfawakalile, na iwatumighwa wake pfawapfalile, na iwanu iwakwambika ichijo, na tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa tsayalapfile hana ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, kakangawala ghendo. <verse eid="1KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Baho kamlongela mfalume Selemani, “Ghose ghanihulike mna isi yangu, aghala ghautendile ghweghwe na ihekima yako ghalongesa. <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Lekeni nene sighatoghole baye mbaka hanitsile na kona kwa nenge tsangu mwenyegho. Kumbe sighahulike baye hata inusi yake, ihekima yako na tsimali tsako tsitsidi kubita aghala ghanihulike. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Wabweda iwanu wako! Wabweda iwatumighwa wako awano iwokusang'anila matsuwa ghose na kutegheletsa ihekima yako. <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako yatunyighwe, iyanoghelighwe naghwe na iyakwikile mna ichighoda cha ufalume cha Isiraeli. Kwaapfila IMNDEWA kowakunda Waisiraeli matsuwa ghose, apfo kakusaghula ghweghwe uwe mfalume ili ulamle ghoya na utende aghala ighomnoghela.”<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Kuya kamwing'a mfalume Selemani kilo tsa nzahabu ka elufu nne, na mapfuta mengi sideke ighonung'ila ghoya, na mabwe gha bei ng'ulu. Na ghamapfuta agho pfaghali mengi sideke malikia wa Sheba ghayamwing'ile Selemani ng'ana ghaghalighwe keli baye.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />Meli tsa Hiramu tsighala nzahabu kulawa Ofiri, na kulawa kuko Ofiri tsighala mibiki mingi ya misandali na mabwe gha bei ng'ulu.<verse eid="1KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Mfalume katsengela imibiki ayo, kaika iwe ya ukukinda hawodina tsingatsi tsa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na ing'anda ya chifalume, na katengenetsela ipfinubi, na pfing'weng'we pfa iwanu iwakwimba. Kulawa litsuwa alyo, mna isi ng'ana ighalighwe keli baye mibiki mingi ka ayo.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Naye mfalume Selemani kamwing'a malikia wa Sheba chila chinu chayalombile, kubita apfila mfalume Selemani pfayamwing'ile kwa uluso wake wa chifalume. Apfo malikia ayo koka kuna isi yake hamwe na watumighwa wake.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsimali tsa mfalume Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Chila mwaka Selemani yang'ali yobokela nzahabu kilo elufu ishilini na tatu. <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />Atso si hamwe baye na tsinzahabu tsayabokele kulawa kwa wachuutsi na wautsa pfinu, na wafalume wa isi tsingi, na iwakulu wa isi ya Isiraeli.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Mfalume Selemani kasongola ngao ng'ulu miya mbili tsa nzahabu ihondighwe, na chila ngao ingila kilo saba tsa nzahabu. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Pfipfila katengenetsa ngao miya ndatu ndodondodo, chila imwe kaikandika nzahabu ka kilo mbili. Mfalume katsika mna ing'anda ikemighwe ng'anda ya Muhulo ghwa Lebanoni.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Kuya mfalume katengenetsa chighoda chikulu cha chifalume kwa membe tsa tembo, kachikandika nzahabu inoghile ng'ani. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Ichighoda acho tsachina ngatsi sita na ubali wake wa kuchanya tsa cha mtsunguluko, na ubali wa kumoso na kujilo chikighwa hanu ha ukwikila ghamoko, na pfinyagho pfa simba weli tsapfima habehi na hanu ha ukwikila ghamoko. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Pfipfila tsahana pfinyagho pfa simba kumi na weli ipfimile hana tsingatsi atso sita, chila chinyagho chimwe chima kwaitsighile ingatsi kumoso na kujilo. Ichighoda ka acho ng'ana chitengenetsighwe baye mna ufalume wowose.<verse eid="1KI 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Ipfinu pfose pfa mfalume pfa ukunwela pfose tsa pfa nzahabu, na ipfinu pfose ipfikalile mna ing'anda ya Ghumuhulo ghwa Lebanoni tsa pfa nzahabu inoghile. Tsakuduhu chinu cha fetsa, kwaapfila fetsa tsayoneka si chinu baye mna ghamatsuwa gha Selemani.<verse eid="1KI 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Kwaapfila mfalume tsakana meli tsa Tarishishi itsing'ali tsikwanga hamwe na tsimeli tsa Hiramu. Chila mwaka ghwa kadatu tsimeli atso tsing'ali tsimghalilagha mfalume nzahabu, fetsa, membe tsa nembo, mahoko na tausi.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Apfo mfalume Selemani tsakawabita wafalume wose wa isi tsose kwa tsimali na kwa ihekima. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Iwanu wa isi tsose tsawabama kumghendela Selemani, wakategheletse ihekima yake Imulungu iyamwing'ile. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Chila munu iyamghendele, kamghalila nzawadi, na tsinzawadi atso tsitso atsino, pfinu pfa fetsa, pfinu pfa nzahabu, magwanda, silaha, mapfuta ighonung'ila ghoya, falasi na punda falasi. Tsinzawadi atsino tsakatsibokela chila mwaka. <verse eid="1KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Selemani tsakaika hamwe imituka ya falasi. Tsakana mituka ya falasi elufu imwe na miya nne, na wadina falasi elufu kumi na mbili, iyawekile mna imiji ya imituka ya falasi, na ako Yerusalemu kwayakalile yeye. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Ako Yerusalemu mfalume Selemani tsakatenda fetsa tsiwe ka mabwe, na imibiki ya miyeletsi tsakaitenda iwa ka mikuyu ili Shefela, pfaili mingi. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Wafalasi wa Selemani tsawasolighwa kulawa Misiri na Kilikia, iwachuutsi wake kwawautsighwe na iwanu wa Kilikia. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Mtuka ghumwe ghwa ukukweghighwa na falasi waghughula kulawa Misiri kwa kilo saba tsa fetsa, na falasi yumwe tsakaghulighwa kwa kilo mbili tsa fetsa. Pfipfila nawo wawautsila imituka ayo iwafalume wose wa Wahiti na wa Wasiria.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Wapinga wa mfalume Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Mfalume Selemani tsakawakunda wapinga wengi iwagheni. Tsakamkwela neghe Farao, lekeni pfipfila kawakwela wapinga wa Wamoabu, Waamoni Waedomu, Wasidoni na Wahiti. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Iwapinga awano wolawa mna isi atsila IMNDEWA tsayawalongele Waisireli apfino, “Mleke ukukwela kuna wawo wala wawo waleke kukwela kuna mwemwe, kwaapfila wawo watsoitenda imomoyo yenu ihundukile milungu yawo.” Lekeni yeye Selemani kananahila ukuwakunda sideke iwapinga awo. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Selemani tsakakwela wapinga miya saba, wose awo tsaneghe wafalume, na kakwela pfimada miya ndatu, na iwapinga wake awo waghutenda ghumoyo ghwake ghwaghe. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Naye hayalalile, iwapinga wake wamwaghitsa ghendo na ghumoyo ghwake ghuhundukila milungu ingi. Kakala akuno ng'amtoghole baye IMNDEWA, Imulungu ka aba wake Daudi pfayamtoghole. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Selemani kamtambikila Ashitoleti mulungu pinga wa Wasidoni, na Milikomu mulungu iyomdesa IMNDEWA iwomtambikila Waamoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Apfo Selemani kamtendela ghehile IMNDEWA, ng'amtegheletse baye IMNDEWA, ka pfayakalile aba wake Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Kuna ichidunda chili mashariki ya Yerusalemu, Selemani kamtsengela Kemoshi hanu ha ukumtambikila, mulungu iyomdesa IMNDEWA iwomtambikila Wamoabu na, kamtsengela Moleki, mulungu iyodesa iwomtambikila Waamoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Pfipfila kawatsengela wapinga wake iwagheni, iwadusule ubani na kuitambikilia milungu yawo. <verse eid="1KI 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />IMNDEWA, kamghudubukila Selemani kwaapfila ghumoyo ghwake tsaghumleka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, iyamlawile Selemani mala mbili. <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />Na kumlaghitsa yaleke kuitambikila milungu ingi, lekeni yeye ng'ategheletse baye achila chayamlaghitse IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Apfo IMNDEWA kamlongela Selemani, “Kwaapfila ghweghwe kutenda apfo, ng'ukindile baye laghano lyangu wala malaghitso ghangu ghanikulaghitse, lelo nitsokuboka ufalume wako na nomwing'a mtumighwa wako. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Kwajili ya aba wako Daudi, sighatenda agha baye mna matsuwa ghako ghaukukala mgima, lekeni nitsouboka mna ghamoko gha iwanagho. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Na yeye sitsomboka baye ufalume wose, lekeni nitsomlekela kabila limwe, kwaajili ya Daudi mtumighwa wangu, na kwaajili ya ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, yanighusaghule.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adui tsake Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamtenda Hadadi iyalawile mna lukolo lwa chifalume lwa Edomu, yawe adui wa Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Ghamatsuwa aghala Daudi hayang'ali yetowa na Edomu, Yoabu mkulu wa maasikali kaghenda kuwatsika iwanu iwakomighwe. Ako kawakoma iwamale wose iwakalile Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yoabu na Waisiraeli tsawakala ako kwa miyetsi sita, hawakomighwe iwamale wose wa Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Lekeni Hadadi, hayang'ali msongolo, katsumila Misiri hamwe na iwanu wa Edomu, iwakalile watumighwa wa aba wake. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Tsawalawa Midiani waghenda Parani. Kuko Parani wasola iwanu wengi woka nawo mbaka Misiri, kwa mfalume Farao wa Misiri. Farao tsakamwing'a Hadadi ng'anda, mghunda, na ichijo. <verse eid="1KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Farao tsakamkunda sideke Hadadi mbaka kamwing'a mlamu wake yamkwele, mdodo wa mwehe wake, malikia Tapenesi. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Ipinga ayo kamwelekela Hadadi mwana mmale iyakemighwe Genubati, naye Tapenese kamlela Genubati mna ing'anda ya Farao hamwe na iwana wa mfalume.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Hadadi hayang'ali ka Misiri, kahulika ka Daudi tsakafa, na Yoabu mlongotsa ng'ondo naye tsakafa. Hadadi kamlongela Farao, “Undeke mbuye kuna isi yangu.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Farao kamghutsa, “Uhungukighwe na chinu chachi ahano hana nene mbaka kobama uye kuna isi yako?” Hadadi kamlongela, “Baye, undeke mbuke!”<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Pfipfila Imulungu kamwinula munu yungi iyakemighwe Rezoni, mwanaghe Eliyada, yamwihile Selemani, iyamtsumile mkulu wake, Hadadezeri, mfalume wa Soba. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Daudi hayawakomile iwanu ako Soba, Rezoni kawakema hamwe maasikali wahozolomo, kawa chilongotsi wa iwanu awo. Kuya maasikali awo wahonzolomo waghenda Damasko, na wakala kuko, na wamwika Rezoni yawe mfalume wa Damasko. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Naye yang'ali yowehila Waisiraeli matsuwa ghose Selemani ghayakalile mgima. Yang'ali yowadununza ka pfayatendile Hadadi, kaibetsa isi ya Isiraeli, na kailongotsa Siriya.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeroboamu komlema mfalume Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Naye Yeroboamu, mwanaghe Nebati, mwefraimu wa Sereda, iyakalile mtumwa wake Selemani, na mai wake taghwa lyake Seruya, iyafilighwe na mmale wake, naye kambiduka mfalume <verse eid="1KI 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Chinu chenyegho ichimtendile Yeroboamu yambiduke mfalume achino ahano, Selemani tsakaisindilia ingema, na kadiwa ubanda wa ghumji ghwa aba wake Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Yeroboamu tsa munu yana ingupfu na iyakindike. Na Selemani hayamwonile imsongolo ayo pfayosang'ana ng'onde tsake pfinoghile, kamwika yemilile ng'onde tsose tsawasang'ane iwanu wa lukolo lwa Yosefu.<verse eid="1KI 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho, Yeroboamu hayang'ali yakuka kulawa Yerusalemu, mnzila ketingana na nabii wa Shilo, iyakemighwe Ahiya, kapfala gholole lya sambisambi. Wose weli tsawayeka mna imighunda. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Baho Ahiya katsula ligholole lyake, kalidegha degha pfihande kumi na pfili. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Kuya kamlongela Yeroboamu, “Sola pfihande kumi, kwaapfila apfi pfipfo pfayolonga IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, ‘Nitsoudegha ufalume uli mmoko mwa Selemani, na nene nitsokwing'a makabila kumi. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Lekeni nitsomlekela kabila limwe kwajili ya mtumighwa wangu Daudi na kwa ghumji ghwangu ghwa Yerusalemu, yanighusaghule mna isi yose ya ghamakabila gha Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Nitsotenda apfo kwaapfila kandeka nene na kamtambikila Ashitaloti mulungu pinga wa Wasidoni, na Kemoshi mulungu wa Wamoabu, na Milikomu mulungu wa Waamoni, na ng'akwanga baye mna tsinzila tsangu, wala ng'otenda baye ighanoghile, na ng'okinda baye ghamalaghitso ghangu, ka pfayatendile Daudi aba wake. <verse eid="1KI 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />Lekeni sitsomboka baye ufalume wose mna ghamoko ghake. Nimtenda yeye yawe mfalume mna ghamatsuwa ghake ghose gha ugima kwajili ya aba wake Daudi mtumighwa wangu, yanimsaghule na iyakindile ghamalaghitso ghangu. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Nitsouboka ufalume awo kulawa mna ghamoko gha imwanaghe na kukwing'a ghweghwe ghamabila kumi. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Nitsomwing'a mwanaghe yumwe kabila limwe ili mtumighwa wangu Daudi, yeye yawe tala ya matsuwa ghose mna Yerusalemu, ilangatsa hambele hangu mna ghumji ghwanighusaghule nyike taghwa lyangu. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Lekeni ghweghwe Yeroboamu, nitsokusola, na kutsotawala chila chinu chaghubama ghumoyo ghwako, kutsakuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Ung'atenda ghose ghanikulaghitsa na kuwinza nzila tsangu, na ung'anendela ghanoghile na kukinda malaghitso ghangu na imiko yangu ka mtumighwa wangu Daudi pfayatendile, nene nitsokala naghwe. Nitsokwing'a isi ya Isiraeli, na kuutenda ufalume wako wime ghoya ka pfanimtendele Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Kwa alino lyayatendile Selemani, nitsowadununza watsukulu wa Daudi, lekeni si matsuwa ghose baye.’”<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Apfo Selemani tsakabama kumkoma Yeroboamu, lekeni Yeroboamu katsumila Misiri kwa Shishaki, iyakalile mfalume wa Misiri, kakala kuko mbaka hayafile Selemani.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Ghangi ghayatendile Selemani, na aghala ghose ghayasang'ane, na ihekima yake, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ghamatendo gha Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Selemani tsakaitawala Isiraeli kwa miyaka alubaini, aku yang'ali yokala Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Selemani kafa, na katsikighwa kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi aba wake, na Rehoboamu imwanaghe kawa mfalume hanu ha aba wake.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Makabila kumi ghombiduka Rohoboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Rehoboamu kaghenda Shekemu, ako Waisraeli wose tsawetingana kumhimika yeye yawe mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Naye Yeroboamu, mwanaghe Nebati iyatsumile Misiri kwa ukumpfuka Selemani, hayahulike apfino, koya kulawa Misiri. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Apfo Waisiraeli watuma wanu waghende wakamkeme Yeroboamu. Kuya yeye na mtingano ghwose ghwa Waisiraeli waghenda kwa Rehoboamu wamlongela, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“Aba wako katutwika mtsigho mtsito, utuhungutsile ghumtsigho aghwo, na twetwe tutsokutumikila.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Rehoboamu kawedika, “Mke na mmbuyile ahano haimala ikacha.” Apfo iwanu woka. <verse eid="1KI 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Rehoboamu kawaghutsa iwanzehe ka wakonatse, awala iwamsang'anile aba wake mna matsuwa ghake ghayakalile mgima. Kawaghutsa, “Mwemwe mwonongela niwedike choni iwanu awano?” <verse eid="1KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Nawo wamwidika, “Ung'atoghola uwe mtumighwa wa iwanu awano leloli na ung'awatumikila, na ung'alonga nawo lughalugha hauwedika, na wao watsakuwa watumighwa wako matsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Lekeni Rehoboamu kabetsa achila chawamlongele iwanzehe, kaghenda kuwaghutsa iwasongolo iwakulile naye na iwang'ali womsang'anila. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Kawaghutsa, “Mwemwe mkonatse? Tutsowedikatse iwanu awano iwanongele niwahungutsile mtsigho ghwawatwikile aba wangu?”<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Iwasongolo awala iwakulile hamwe naye wamwidika, “Walongele iwanu awo iwalongile, ‘Aba wako katutwika mtsigho mtsito, utuhungutsile ghumtsigho aghwo’, naghwe walongele apfino, ‘Ichidole changu chidoghodogho chinene kubita ichuno cha aba wangu. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Aba wangu kawatwika mwemwe mtsigho mtsito, lekeni nene nitsakongetsa ghuwe mtsito ng'ani. Aba wangu kawafapulani kwa mbalati, lekeni nene nitsowafapulani kwa mijeleledi ya mihonga.’” <verse eid="1KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Ikacha yake Yeroboamu na iwanu wose woya kwa Rehoboamu, ka pfayawalongele mfalume, “Muye ahano ikacha.” <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Mfalume kawedika iwanu kwa kuwamanila, kaleka achila chawamlongele iwanzehe, <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />kategheletsa achila chawamlongele iwasongolo hawalongile, “Aba wangu kawatwika msigho mtsito, nene nowongetsa ghwakuwa mtsito ng'ani. Aba wangu kawafapulani na mbalati, na nene nitsowafapulani kwa mijeledi ina mihonga.” <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Apfo mfalume ng'awategheletse baye iwanu, kwaapfila chinu achino chilawa kwa IMNDEWA, ili imbuli yake ilawile, iyamlongele Yeroboamu mwanaghe Nebati kubitila Ahiya iyawile Shiloni.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Waisiraeli wose hawonile mfalume kalema kuwategheletsa wamwidika pfino: “Tuna choni kwa mfalume Daudi, tuna hanu hachi kwa mwana wa Yese? Lelo mke kuna lihema lyenu, mwemwe Waisiraeli, ilolese ng'anda yako mwenyegho, ghwe Daudi.” Apfo Waisiraeli woka kuna ghamahema ghawo. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Lekeni kwa Waisiraeli iwang'ali wokala mna imiji ya Yuda, Rehoboamu yang'ali iyowatawala. <verse eid="1KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Kuya mfalume Rehoboamu kamtuma Adoramu, iyakalile mkulu wa ng'onde tsa kunanahitsighwa, lekeni Waisiraeli wose wamkoma kwa kumtowa na mabwe. Mfalume Rehoboamu kadina mtuka ghwake ghwa ukukweghighwa na falasi, katsumila Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Apfo Waisiraeli woluhila lukolo lwa Daudi mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="1KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Waisiraeli wose hawahulike Yeroboamu koya, wamkema hana mtingano ghwa iwanu na baho wamsaghula yawe mfalume wa Isiraeli yose. Tsakuduhu munu yalukololetse lukolo lwa Daudi, ila lukolo lwa Yuda luliyeka.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shemaya kotabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Rehoboamu hayapfikile Yerusalemu, kawakema hamwe maasikali laki imwe na elufu semanini kulawa mna likabila lya Yuda na lya Benjamini, iwadahile ukwitowa pfinoghile, waketowe na wanu wa Isiraeli, ili woyitse keli ufalume kwa Rehoboamu mwanaghe Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Lekeni imbuli ya Imulungu imtsila Shemeya, imunu wa Imulungu, <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />“Mlongele Rehoboamu mwana wa Selemani na iwanu wose wa likabila lya Yuda na lya Benjamini na iwanu wose, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />nene IMNDEWA nolonga apfino, ‘Mleke kughenda na ukwitowa na ndughu tsenu Waisiraeli. Chila munu yoke ukaye yake kwaapfila chinu achino chilawa kuna nene.’” Apfo wategheletsa chayalongile IMNDEWA, na woya ukaye ka pfayalaghitse IMNDEWA.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfinyagho pfa ng'ombe wa nzahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Kuya Yeroboamu kaghutsenga keli ghumji ghwa Shekemu ighuli mna chidunda cha Eufraimu na kakala kuko. Kuya koka kaghenda kughutsenga ghumji ghwa Penueli. <verse eid="1KI 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Baho Yeroboamu kanza kwilongela mwenyegho, “Lelo ng'ambe ufalume wakuya keli kwa lukolo lwa Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />Ka iwanu awano watsoghendelela kughenda kutambika kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu ako Yerusalemu, kuko imomoyo yawo itsomhundukila mkulu wawo Rehoboamu mfalume wa Yuda. Nawo watsong'oma na wakuya kwa mfalume wawo Rehoboamu.” <verse eid="1KI 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Hayawaghutsile iwanu choni cha ukutenda, baho kafina pfinyagho pfili pfa ng'ombe wa nzahabu, kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwipfa ghendo kughenda Yerusalemu ukutambika. Lelo mwemwe Waisiraeli aino milungu yenu iwalapfile Misiri.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Keka chinyagho chimwe cha ing'ombe mna ghumji ghwa Beteli na chinyagho chingi mna ghumji ghwa Dani. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Chinu achino chiwa nzambi kwaapfila iwanu tsawaghenda hata Dani ili kutali ghendo kuchitambikila. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Kuya Yeroboamu katsenga matsabahu hanu ha ukutambikila, kawasaghula iwanu wawe watambika, iwanu iwali si wa lukolo lwa Lawi baye.<verse eid="1KI 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutambika hana tsimatsabahu tsilemighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Yeroboamu katenda chihungo mna ghumwetsi ghwa nane ghwa tsuwa lya kumi na tano, chiwe ka chihungo ichitendekagha mna isi ya Yuda, na kalapfa nambiko hana imatsabahu. Katenda pfipfo ako Beteli kwa ukutambika hana ichinyagho cha ing'ombe iyamfinile. Na kuko Beteli kaweka iwatambika hanu ha ukutambikila hayatsengile. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Mna litsuwa lya kumi na tano lya ghumwetsi ghwa nane, iyaghusaghule yeye mwenyegho, kalapfa nambiko hana imatsabahu iyaitsengile ako Beteli. Apfo katenda chihungo acho chiwe cha wanu wa Isiraeli na kagheluka kune matsabahu kudusula ubani.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Yeroboamu hayang'ali kema hana imatsabahu yapfukitse ufumba, baho imunu we Imulungu yatumighwe na IMNDEWA kulawa Yuda kapfika aho Beteli. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Kailonga imatsabahu ayo ka IMNDEWA pfayamlongele, kakemelela, “Ghwe matsabahu, matsabahu, IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Imwana iyokemighwa Yosia katsakoneka mna lukolo lwa Daudi. Yeye katsowadumula iwanu iwotambika mpfidando, iwolapfa nambiko ahano na imipate ya iwanu awo katsoilakatsa mchanya mwako.’” <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Tsuwa lilyo imunu wa Imulungu keka chitango, kalonga, “Achi chicho ichitango chayalongile IMNDEWA, ‘Imatsabahu itsomegheka, na lipfu ilili mchanya mwake litsomwaghika.’”<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Naye mfalume Yeroboamu hayahulike apfila imunu wa Imulungu pfayailongile imatsabahu ako Beteli, kagholosa ghumoko kulawa hana imatsabahu kuya kalonga, “Mghogheni.” Lekeni ghumoko ghwagholose kuna imunu ayo ghuholola, apfo ng'audahile baye kukunjika keli. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Pfipfila imatsabahu nayo imegheka, ka chitango chayalongile imunu wa Imulungu iyeng'ighwe longa lye IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Apfo mfalume Yeroboamu kamlongela imunu wa Imulungu, “Nokulomba unilombele kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, ghumoko ghwangu ghugholoke.” Apfo Imunu wa Imulungu kamlomba IMNDEWA, na ghumoko ghwa mfalume ghuya keli na ghuwa ka aho mwanduso. <verse eid="1KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Mfalume kamlongela imunu ayula we Imulungu, “Utse ukaye yangu ukaje ichijo na nene, kuko nitsokugweka.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Lekeni imunu we Imulungu kamwidika, “Hata ka ung'angaya inusu ya pfose pfaunapfo, nene sitsoghenda naghwe baye, wala sitsakuja baye wala kunwa ghamatsi hanu ahano. <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />Kwaapfila Imulungu kandaghitsa ndeke ukuja, wala ukunwa ghamatsi, wala kuya ukaye kwa nzila ihila yanitsilile nayo.” <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Apfo koya kwa kwang'a nzila ingi, na ng'ohile baye kwa nzila ihila iyatsile nayo.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inabii wa Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Kuko Beteli tsakuna nabii yumwe mnzehe, wanaghe wamghendela na wamlongela ghose ghayatendile imunu wa Imulungu aho Beteli tsuwa lilyo. Pfipfila wamlongela aba wawo achila chayamlongele mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Naye aba wawo kawaghutsa, “Yang'ile nzila yachi?” Na iwanaghe wamlangusa inzila iyabitile imunu wa Imulungu iyalawile Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Apfo Kawalongela iwanaghe, “Mtandike chilagho mchanya mwe ipunda,” Nawo hawachitandike mchanya mwa ipunda, naye kamdina. <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />Kamuwinza imunu ayula wa Imulungu na kampfika kakala hasi, hana ghumbiki ghwa mwaloni, baho kamghutsa, “Pfihi ghweghwe kwa munu wa Imulungu yulawile Yuda?” Naye kamwidika, “Ona, na nene.”<verse eid="1KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Apfo inabii ayula kamlongela, “Tuke ukaye yangu, tukaje ichijo.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Imunu wa Imulungu kamlongela, “Sikuya baye kuchughu na kuka naghwe, wala sikwingila baye mng'anda mwako na sikuja ichijo baye wala kunwa ghamatsi hanu ahano. <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />Kwaapfila Imulungu kandaghitsa ndeke kuja chijo wala kunwa ghamatsi hanu ahano, wala kuyila inzila aino yutsile nayo ghweghwe.”<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Inabii ayula imnzehe kamlongela, “Pfipfila nene na nabii ka pfauli ghweghwe, na imalaika we Imulungu kanongela kwa longa lye IMNDEWA, ‘Umuyitse ukaye yako yaje ichijo na yanwe ghamatsi.’” Lekeni inabii ayo imnzehe yang'ali yomghutsukila. <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Apfo imunu ayo we Imulungu koya naye ukaye yake, kuya kaja ichijo na kanwa ghamatsi naye.<verse eid="1KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Hawang'ali wakuja longa lya IMNDEWA limtsila inabii ayula imnzehe, iyamhitse kuchughu imunu we Imulungu. <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />Kamkembela imunu ayula we Imulungu iyalawile muisi ya Yuda, “Achi chicho chayolonga IMNDEWA, ‘kwaapfila ng'utegheletse baye longa lya IMNDEWA, na ng'ukindile baye laghitso lyayakulaghitse IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Lekeni ghweghwe kuya kuchughu na kuja ichijo na kunwa ghamatsi hanu hanikughomile uleke kuja, wala kunwa ghamatsi. Apfo lukuli lwako ng'alutsotsikighwa baye hana ghamakabuli gha sekulu tsako.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Imunu wa Imulungu hayamalitse ukuja na ukunwa, inabii iyamhitse kuchughu katandika chilagho mchanya mwe ipunda yamdine. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Na hayang'ali kamnzila kakuka, isimba ketingana naye mnzila kamkoma, na lukuli lwake lwasighwa mnzila, ipunda wake na simba wose wema hambalimbali hake. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Iwanu iwapfosile aho wona lukuli lwasighwa mnzila, aku isimba kema habehi na ilukuli, waghenda kulonga kuna ghumji ghwayang'ali yokala inabii iyalalile.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Inabii iyamhitse kuchughu hayahulike chinu acho, kalonga, “Imunu we Imulungu ng'ategheletse baye longa lya IMNDEWA, apfo IMNDEWA kamtuma isimba yampfingilile kuya kamkoma ka longa lya Imulungu pfalimkanyile.”<verse eid="1KI 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Inabii kawalongela iwanaghe, “Mnitandikile chilagho mchanya mwe ipunda,” nawo wamtandikila. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Naye koka, kalyona lukuli lwasighwa mnzila aku isimba na punda wema habehi nalwo, isimba ayula ng'alujile baye lukuli, wala ng'amjile ipunda baye. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Apfo inabii ayo kalusola lukuli lwa imunu wa Imulungu, kalwika mchanya mwe punda na kalughala kuna ghumji ghwake, kuko kamlilila kuya kamtsika. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Kuya kalutsika lukuli alyo hana likabuli lyake mwenyegho, yeye na iwanaghe wamlilila na walonga, “Wenye ghwe ndughu yangu!”<verse eid="1KI 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Na hawamtsikile, kawalongela iwanaghe, “Hanikufa, nitsikeni hana likabuli lyayatsikighwe imunu wa Imulungu, ikeni mipate yangu habehi na mipate yake. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Kwapfila ghatsolawila ghendo aghala ghose ghayalongile ahala hayailongile imatsabahu na pfidanando pfose pfa kutambikila pfili mna imiji ya Samaria kwa longa lya IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzambi ng'ulu ya Yeroboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Yeroboamu ng'alekile baye ghehile ghake, lekeni yeye kaghendelelela kuwasaghula iwanu wowose wakatambike hana ipfidando. Na munu wowose yabamile kuwa mtambika, yeye kamsaghula yawe mtambika wa kupfidando. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Chinu achino chiwa nzambi ng'ulu, na chihonza lukolo wa Yeroboamu luhupe na ng'alyoneke keli baye muisi.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Matsuwa agho Abiya mwanaghe mmale Yeroboamu yang'ali yoghula. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Apfo Yeroboamu kamlongela mwehe wake, “Ghenda na wiketende ka munu yungi, waleke kukutanga ka kwa mwehe wa Yeroboamu, kuya ghenda Shilo, ako kakuko nabii Ahiya iyanongele nene nitsakuwa mfalume wa iwanu awano. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Sola pfighate kumi na maandatsi na chibuyu china iuki, umghalile. Naye katsokulongela choni chitsomlawila imwana wetu.”<verse eid="1KI 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Apfo mwehe wa Yeroboamu katenda ka pfayamlongele mmale wake na kaghenda Shilo ukaye kwa Ahiya. Matsuwa agho tsinenge tsa Ahiya ng'atsing'ali tsikwona pfinoghile baye kwaapfila tsakalala. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kamlongela Ahiya, “Mwehe wa Yeroboamu kakutsa kughutsa ighatsomlawila imwanaghe iyoghula, naghwe umwidike apfino na apfino. Naye hayopfika, ketenda ka munu yungi.”<verse eid="1KI 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Apfo Ahiya hayahulike ichisindo cha ghamaghulu ghake hana lilango, kamlongela, “Wingile mng'anda, ghweghwe mwehe wa Yeroboamu. Lekeni heule witenda ka kwa munu yungi. Nitumighwa nikulongele mbuli ihile. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Ghenda kamlongele Yeroboamu, IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli kolonga apfino, ‘Nikusaghula ghweghwe kulawa kwa iwanu na nikwika uwe chilongotsi wa iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />Niwaboka ufalume iwatsukulu wa Daudi, na nikwing'a ghweghwe, lekeni ghweghwe ng'uwile baye ka mtumighwa wangu Daudi, iyakindile ghamalaghitso ghangu na iyaniwinzile nene kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghwose, iyatendile ighanoghile ghaliyeka hambele ha tsinenge tsangu. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Lekeni ghweghwe kutenda ghehile mengi kubita awala iwakulongole, kwitendela milungu ingi na kufina pfinyagho pfa chuma, kunitenda nene ngundubuke, na kunyasa kuchughu kwako. <verse eid="1KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />Apfo nitsotenda ghehile ghalawile mna iwanu wa ikaye ya Yeroboamu, nitsomkoma chila mwana mmale mtsuwanda wa ilukolo lwa Yeroboamu mna isi yose ya Isiraeli, yawe mtumwa au si mtumwa baye. Nitsowatenda iwanu wa ikaye ya Yeroboamu wahupe ghendo ka imunu pfayobiha imipfi mbaka imale. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Imunu wowose iyolowa mna ilukolo lwa Yeroboamu yang'afila ukaye, wambwa watsomja na ayula iyakufila kumghunda, wapfideghe iwali mlanga watsomja. Nilonga apfo nene IMNDEWA.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />Ahiya kamlongela mwehe wa Yeroboamu, “Lelo winuke, uye ukaye yako. Naghwe haufika kuna ghumji, baho imwana katsakufa. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Waisiraeli wose watsomlilila na watsomtsika. Yeye yaliyeka kulawa mna ilukolo lwa Yeroboamu iyatsotsikighwa, kwaapfila mna ilukolo lwa Yeroboamu yeye kayeka iyamnoghetse IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />Na leloli aino IMNDEWA katsomwinula mfalume yungi mna isi ya Isiraeli, iyatsoludumula ilukolo lwa Yeroboamu. Ona leloli aino! <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />IMNDEWA katsowatowa wanu wa Isiraeli, nawo watsohighisika ka lutsani pfaluhighisika mmatsi, katsowabula Waisraeli walawe mna isi aino inoghile iyaweng'ile sekulu tsawo, naye katsowapwililisa kutali, kumwambu kwa ghumto Eufrate, kwaapfila wamtenda IMNDEWA yaghudubuke kwa kwisongolela pfinyagho pfa Ashera. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />IMNDEWA katsowaleka iwanu wa Isiraeli kwa ghehile ghayatendile Yeroboamu, na kawahonza Waisiraeli nawo watende ghehile.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Kuya imwehe wake Yeroboamu kenuka koka, kaghenda Tiriza, na hayakanyaghe ichitsingiti cha lilango, baho imwana kafa. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Waisiraeli wose wamtsika na wamdomboketsela, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlongele mtumighwa wake nabii Ahiya.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Yeroboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Chila chinu chayatendile Yeroboamu, apfila pfayetowile kwing'ondo, na apfila pfayatawale, pfose pfandikighwa mna chitabu cha matsuwa cha iwafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Yeroboamu tsakatawala kwa miyaka ishilini na mili, kuya kafa. Na imwanaghe iyakemighwe Nadabu kawa mfalume, kakinda hanu hake.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Rehoboamu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Naye Rehoboamu imwanaghe Selemani kanza kuitawala isi ya Yuda aku kana miyaka alubaini na ghumwe, na katawala miyaka kumi na saba kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, ghumji iyaghusaghule IMNDEWA kulawa ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli, ghuwe hanu ha ukumtambikila yeye. Na mai wake kakemighwa Naama, munu wa Amoni.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Wanu wa Yuda wamtendela ghehile IMNDEWA, wamtenda yaghudubuke kwa ghehile ghao ghawatendile, tsamengi kubita aghala ghose ghawatendile sekulu tsawo. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Pfipfila watsenga hanu ha ukutambikila mna ipfidanando, na weka tsingutso tsa ghamabwe, na pfinyagho pfa Ashera chila hana ichidunda, na chila hana ichimbeho cha mbiki mkulu. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Chinu chihile kubita pfose, tsakuna mapinga pfiweghe, na wamale iwowasa na wamale wayawo, iwang'ali wokalagha baho mna ipfidanando pfawo pfa ukutambikila pfili mna isi. Wanu wa Yuda watenda pfinu pfa kudesa ipfitendighwe na iwanu wa isi tsingi iyawawingile IMNDEWA hambele ha Waisiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa tano ghwa ukutawala mfalume Rehoboamu, mfalume Shishaki wa Misiri kagheluka katsa kughutowa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Kasola pfinu pfose pfili mna ing'anda ya Imulungu, na pfose pfili mna ing'anda ya mfalume, kasola ghendo chila chinu. Pfipfila kasola tsingawo tsose tsa nzahabu tsayatengenetse Selemani. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Apfo mfalume Rehoboamu katengenetsa ngawo tsingi tsa shaba hanu ha atsila tsa nzahabu itsisolighwe, kuya kaweng'a iwakalitsi wakulu watsibetetse, awala iwang'ali wokalitsagha lilango lya ing'anda ya mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Chila mala mfalume hayaghendile kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu, iwakalitsi watsikinda tsingawo atso, na hambele watsuyitsa kuna ichiheleto cha iwakalitsi. <verse eid="1KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Ghamatendo ghangi na chila chinu chayatendile Rehoboamu mna utawala wake, pfose pfandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Rehoboamu na Yeroboamu wang'ali wetowagha matsuwa ghawo ghose. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Rehoboamu kafa na katsikighwa ahala hawatsikighwe sekulu tsake kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi. Na mai wake kakemighwa Naama, kulawa Amoni. Na Abiya, imwanaghe katawala hanu hake.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Abiya wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Abiya kanza kuitawala isi ya Yuda mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na nane ghwa ukutawala mfalume Yeroboamu mwanaghe Nebati. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />Katawala kwa miyaka midatu ako Yerusalemu. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Maaka neghe Absalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Katenda nzambi tsitsila tsayatendile aba wake, ghumoyo ghwake ng'aghulapfile baye kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake, ka pfaghukalile ghumoyo ghwa sekulu wake Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Lekeni kwaajili ya Daudi, IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake kamwing'a mwana mmale yatawale hanu hake, na yawe tala ilangangatsa Yerusalemu, na yaghutende ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ghwime ghoya. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />IMNDEWA katenda apfo kwaapfila Daudi tsakamtendela IMNDEWA ighanoghile wala ng'alemile baye kukinda aghala ghose ghayamlaghitse mna ghamatsuwa ghose ghayakalile mgima, ila kwa lighomba alila lya Uria, Mhiti. <verse eid="1KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Rehoboamu na Yeroboamu tsawang'ali wetowa, na ing'ondo ayo ighendelela mbaka mna ghamatsuwa ghose gha Abiya hayakalile mgima. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Ghamatendo ghangi na chila chinu chayatendile Abiya mna utawala wake, pfose pfandikighwa mna ichitabu cha tsikumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Yuda. Abiya na Yeroboamu wang'ali woghendelela ukwitowa. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Abiya kafa na wamtsika mna ghumji ghwa Daudi. Apfo Asa imwanaghe katawala hanu hake.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Asa wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa ishilini ghwa mfalume Yeroboamu wa Isiraeli, Asa kanza kutawala isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />Katawala miyaka alubaini na ghumwe ako Yerusalemu. Bibi yake tsakakemighwa Maaka, neghe Abusalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Mfalume Asa kamtendela ghanoghile IMNDEWA, ka pfayatendile Daudi, sekulu wake. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Kawawinga ipfiweghe na iwamale iwowasa na wamale wayao iwang'ali wokala hanu ha ukutambikila, kapfasa ipfiyagho pfose pfawatendile sekulu tsake. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Pfipfila kamlapfa Maaka iyakalile mai wake yaleke kuwa keli malikia, kwaapfila tsakatenda chinyagho cha Ashera. Asa kachibenabena ichinyagho acho na kachilakatsa mna ulwanda wa Kidironi. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Hata ka ipfidanando pfa ukutambikila milungu ingi ng'apfihinyile baye, ghumoyo ghwa Asa ghughendelela kumtoghola IMNDEWA mna ghamatsuwa ghake ghose ghayakalile mgima. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Kapfingitsa mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA pfinu pfose pfayapfilapfile aba wake kwa Imulungu, hamwenga na pfinu pfake pfayapfilapfile imwenyegho kwa Imulungu, kengitsa ipfinu pfa nzahabu, pfa fetsa, na pfinu pfingi.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Mfalume Asa wa Yuda na mfalume Baasha wa Isiraeli wang'ali wetowagha matsuwa ghose gha ufalume wawo. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Mfalume Baasha wa Isiraeli kaitowa isi ya Yuda, kuya katsenga ubanda kughutsunguluka ghumji ghwa Rama, ili munu wowose yaleke kulawa wala kwingila mna isi ya Asa, mfalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Apfo Asa kasola ifetsa na inzahabu itsikalile mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA na mna ing'anda yake ya chifalume na kaweng'a watumighwa wake. Mfalume Asa kawatuma waghende Damasko kwa Beni Hadadi mwanaghe Tabrimoni, mtsukulu wa Hezioni, mfalume wa Siriya, kalonga, <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />“Nobama twike laghano, nene na ghweghwe, ka apfila aba wangu na aba wako pfawekile laghano. Lola, nokughalila nzawadi ya nzahabu na fetsa, ili laghano lyawikile ghweghwe na Baasha mfalume wa Isiraeli litsighe na yeye yawalapfe asikali wake kulawa kuna isi yangu.”<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Beni Hadadi kamtogholela mfalume Asa, kawatuma wakulu wake wa ing'ondo wakaitowe imiji ya Isiraeli. Waghusola ghumji ghwa Iyoni, na ghwa Dani, na ghwa Abeli Beti Maaka, na ghwa Kineroti, na isi yose ya Nafutali. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Naye mfalume Baasha hayahulike apfo, kaleka kutsenga ubanda utsunguluka Rama, kaghenda kukala Tirza. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Kuya mfalume Asa kawalaghitsa iwanu wose wa Yuda, yaleke kulekighwa munu wowose ayula, wakadute ghamabwe na imibiki kulawa Rama, iyang'ali yotsengela Baasha. Kuya mfalume Asa kasola ghamabwe agho na imibiki ayo katsengela ubanda wa ghumji ghwa Geba ighuli mna isi ya Benyamini, na ubanda wa ghumji ghwa Mizipa. <verse eid="1KI 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Ghamatendo ghangi gha Asa, na tsingupfu tsake pfitsili, na imiji yose iyaitsengile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Yuda. Lekeni hayawile mnzehe yang'ali yoghula ghamaghulu. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Asa kafa na katsikighwa mna ghamakabuli gha sekulu tsake mna ghumji ghwa Daudi. Imwanaghe Yehoshafati kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nadabu Mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Nadabu mwanaghe Yeroboamu kanza kuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli mna ghumwaka ghwa keli ghwa mfalume Asa wa Yuda, katawala Isiraeli kwa miyaka mili. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Nadabu katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, kawinza nzila tsa aba wake, inzambi iyatendile iwahonza Waisiraeli nawo waitenda.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Baasha mwanaghe Ahiya, iyolawa mna likabila lya Isakali, kamtendela tsengwe Nadabu, na kamkoma ahala Nadabu na Waisiraeli wose hawang'ali woghutsingila ghumji ghwa Gibetoni, mji ghwa Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Baasha kamkoma Nadabu mna ghumwaka ghwa kadatu ghwa mfalume Asa. Naye kawa mfalume hanu hake. <verse eid="1KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Baho hayanzile ukutawala, Baasha kawakoma iwanu wose wa ilukolo lwa Yeroboamu. Ng'amlekile baye munu wowose wa Yeroboamu yahumule, yeye kawakoma wose, apfo lilawila alila IMNDEWA lyayalongile kubitila imtumighwa wake nabii Ahiya wa Shilo. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Aghano ghamlawila kwa ajili ya inzambi iyatendile Yeroboamu, na apfila pfayawahonzile Wasiraeli watende ghehile, na kamtenda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli yaghudubuke.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Aghala ghose gha Nadabu ighakalile na ghose ghayatendile, ng'ambe ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Asa na mfalume Baasha wa Isiraeli wang'ali wetowagha matsuwa ghose gha ukutawala kwawo.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baasha mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Na mna ghumwaka ghwa kadatu ghwa mfalume Asa wa Yuda, Baasha mwana wa Ahiya kanza kuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli kulawa Tiriza. Katawala kwa miyaka ishilini na mine. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Baasha kamtendela ghehile IMNDEWA, na kamwigha Yeroboamu. Naye katenda nzambi iila imtendile yawahonze iwanu wa Isiraeli waitende.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Longa lya IMNDEWA limtsila nabii Yehu mwanaghe Hanani, limlonga Baasha apfino, <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />“Nene nikwinula kulawa mtimbwisi na nikutenda uwe chilongotsi wa iwanu wangu Isiraeli. Ghweghwe kumwigha Yeroboamu na kuwahonza wanu wangu wa Isiraeli watende nzambi, na kunenda nene nighudubuke kwa nzambi tsawo tsawanendele. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Apfo nitsommalitsa Baasha na iwanu wa ikaye yake, na nitsowatendela iwanu wa ikaye yake ka pfaniwatendele iwanu wa ikaye ya Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Munu wowose wa Baasha iyakufila ukaye wambwa watsomja, na ayula iyakufila kumghunda wapfideghe wali mlanga watsomja.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Ghangi ghayatendile Baasha mna ukutalawa kwake, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Baasha kafa na katsikighwa Tiriza na mwanaghe Ela kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Lilonga alila lya IMNDEWA limtsila nabii Yehu mwanaghe Hanani, kumlonga Baasha na wanu wake tsalitsa kwapfila tsakatenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA. Kamtenda yaghudubuke kwa aghala ghayatendile kwa ghamoko ghake, katenda ghaghala ghayatendile Yeroboamu na iwanu wake. IMNDEWA pfipfila kaghudubuka kwaapfila Baasha tsakawakoma iwanu wa ikaye ya Yeroboamu.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ela mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa ishilini na sita ghwa mfalume Asa wa Yuda, Ela mwanaghe Baasha kawa mfalume, naye katawala ako Tiriza kwa miyaka mili.<verse eid="1KI 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Lekeni Zimri, imtumighwa wake, iyemilile inusu ya imituka yake ya ukukweghighwa, tsakabama yamkome. Matsuwa agho, Ela yang'ali yakunwa imbwali mna ing'anda ya Arisa, iyakalile mkulu wa ing'anda ya chifalume ya Tiriza. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Apfo Zimri kengila mng'anda kamtowa mbaka kamkoma. Kuya Zimri kawa mfalume, kakinda hanu hake. Alino lilawila Asa hayawile mfalume wa Yuda kwa miyaka ishirini na saba.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Baho Zimri hayanzile kutawala, na kukalila chighoda chake cha ufalume, kawakoma wanu wose wa ikaye ya Baasha, ng'amlekile baye hata mmale yumwe, yawe ndughu au sale yake. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Apfo Zimri kawakoma iwanu wa ikaye ya Baasha ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayamlongile Baasha kubitila nabii Yehu. <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Agho ghalawila kwaajili ya tsinzambi tsose tsawatendile Baasha na imwanaghe Ela, itsiwahonzile Waisiraeli nawo watende nzambi, apfo wamtenda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli yaghudubuke kwa pfinyagho pfa imilungu yawo. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Ghangi ghayatendile Ela mna ukutalawa kwake, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zimri mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa ishilini na saba ghwa mfalume Asa wa Yuda, Zimri tsakatawala kwa matsuwa saba ako Tiriza. Lelo wanu wa Isiraeli weka indalo yawo habehi na ghumji ghwa Gibetoni, ghwa Wafilisti. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Na iwanu wa Isiraeli hawahulike ka Zimri katenda tsengwe kamkoma mfalume, baho wamsaghula Omri, mkulu wa ng'ondo, yawe mfalume wa Isiraeli mna litsuwa lilyo. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Apfo Omri akuno kelongotsa na Waisiraeli walawa Gibetoni, waghenda kughutowa ghumji ghwa Tiriza. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Na Zimri hayonile ghumji ghusolighwa, kaghenda kuna lihandaki ilili mna ing'anda ya mfalume, kailakatsa ing'anda ayo, naye kafila mumo. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Ilawila apfo kwa tsinzambi tsayatendile, tsakatenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, katenda ghaghala ghayatendile Yeroboamu na ghayawahonzile Waisiraeli watende. <verse eid="1KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Ghangi ghayatendile Zimri mna ukutalawa kwake, na litsengwe lyayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna chitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omri mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Hayafile Zimri, iwanu wa Isiraeli wagholeka mna makingili meli, wamwenga wambama Tibini mwana wa Ginati yawe mfalume wawo, na wanu wamwenga wambama Omri. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Lekeni iwanu iwambamile Omri tsawana ngupfu kubita iwanu iwambamile Tibini mwana wa Ginathi, apfo Tibini kafa na Omri kawa mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa salasini na ghumwe ghwa mfalume Asa wa Yuda, Omri kanza kutawala Isiraeli, katawala kwa miyaka kumi na mili, miyaka sita ako Tiriza. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Kaghula ichidunda cha Samaria, kwa kilo sabini tsa fetsa kulawa kwa munu iyakemighwe Shemeri, katsenga ghumji mchanya mwa ichidunda acho, na kaghukema ghumji agho Samaria, iwanu wamkumbukeghe Shemeri, imunu iyana ichidunda acho ghumwande.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Omri katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, katenda ghehile kubita wafalume wose iwamlongolele, <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />kwaapfila katenda ghaghala ghayatendile Yeroboamu, mwana wa Nebati, na kwa tsinzambi tsake kawahonza Waisiraeli. Apfo wamtenda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli yaghudubuke kwa kutambikila pfinyagho pfa milungu. <verse eid="1KI 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Ghangi ghayatendile Omri mna ukutalawa kwake, na ghose ighanoghile, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Omri kafa na katsikighwa ako Samaria, na mwanaghe Ahabu kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahabu Mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Mna umwaka wa salasini na nane wa ukutawala Asa mfalume wa Yuda, Ahabu mwana wa Omri kawa mfalume wa Isiraeli, na kaitawala Isiraeli aku kakala Samaria kwa miyaka ishilini na mili. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Naye Ahabu kamtendela IMNDEWA ghehile kubita wafalume wose iwamlongolele. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Ng'onile baye ka pfiha ukutenda aghala ighehile ghayatendile Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, lekeni pfipfila kamkwela Yezebeli neghe Etibaali, mfalume wa Sidoni, na kanza kumsang'anila na kumtambikila Baali. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Kamtsengela Baali matsabahu mghati mwa ing'anda ya ukutambikila iyamtsengele Baali ako Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Pfipfila Ahabu katenda chinyagho cha Ashela mulungu pinga. Ahabu kamtenda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli yaghudubuke kubita wafalume wose iwamlongolele yeye. <verse eid="1KI 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Mna ghamatsuwa ghake Ahabu gha ufalume, Hieli iyolawa Beteli, kaghutsenga keli ghumji ghwa Yeriko. Ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayalongile kubitila Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, Hieli kafilighwa na imwanaghe mmale chaudele Abiramu hayang'ali yakwika ghumsingi ghwa Yeriko, na pfipfila kafilighwa na imwanaghe mmale mtsuwanda, iyakemighwe Segubu, hayang'ali yakwika ghamalango gha Yeriko. Ilawila ka pfipfila pfayalongile IMNDEWA kubitila mtumighwa wake Yoshua mwana wa Nuni.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Eliya koitenda imvula ileke kutowa muisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Apfo Eliya iyolawa Tishibi ili muisi ya Gileadi, kamlongela mfalume Ahabu, “Nelaha ghendo kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli iyali mgima yanimtumikila nene, ng'akutsakuwa na tungwe baye wala mvula mna imiyaka aino ikutsa mbaka nene hanitsolonga itowe.”<verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Kuya longa lya IMNDEWA limtsila Eliya, lilonga, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />“Uke ahano ughenda mashariki, ghenda wikepfitse hana ichikolongo cha Keriti, ichili kumwambu mwa Yoridani. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Ako kutsakunwa ghamatsi mna ichikolongo acho, na kuko niwalaghitsa wabondwa wakwing'e ichijo.”<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Apfo katenda achila IMNDEWA chayamlongele, kaghenda kukala hana ichikolongo cha Keriti chili kumwambu mwa Yoridani. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Wabondwa wamghalila chighate na nyama nemitondo, na wamghalila chighate na nyama nemihe, na kanwa ghamatsi gha ichikolongo acho. <verse eid="1KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Lekeni matsuwa haghabitile, hambele ichikolongo acho chinyala, kwaapfila imvula ng'aitowile baye muisi.<verse eid="1KI 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pinga chitsuka wa Sarefati.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Baho Longa lya IMNDEWA limtsila Eliya, <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />“Ghenda Sarefati, isi ili Sidoni, na ukale kuko, kwaapfila nimlaghitsa pinga chitsuka iyokala kuko yakakwing'e ichijo.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Apfo kaghenda Sarefathi. Hayapfikile hana lilango lya isi, kampfika pinga yumwe chitsuka kodondola ngodi. Eliya kamkema ipinga ayo na kamlongela, “Ndetele ghamatsi chidogho nuwe.” <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Na hayang'ali yoghenda kuleta ghamatsi, Eliya kamkema kamlongela, “Pfipfila ungalile chihande chidodo cha ichighate.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Lekeni ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Nelaha ghendo kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako iyali mgima, nene nahela chighate, chanilinacho usaghe chidogho uli mchiya na mapfuta chidogho ighali msupa. Sambi nodondola tsingodi nikeyambikile ukaye ichijo nene na mwanangu tuje, kuya inzala itukome.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Eliya kamlongela, “Uleke kupfuka. Ghenda na tenda ka pfaulongile. Lekeni tanu unyambikile nene chighate chidodo kwa usaghe uli nawo, na ungalile, kuya wambike chighate chako na cha imwanagho. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli kolonga apfino, ‘Utimbo uli mchiya mwako ng'autsohunguka baye, wala ghamapfuta ghali msupa mwako ng'aghatsomala baye mbaka IMNDEWA hayatsoghala imvula muisi.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Apfo ipinga ayula kaghenda na katenda ka Eliya pfayamlongele. Apfo Eliya na ipinga ayula chitsuka na iwanu wa ikaye yake wawa na ichijo ichiwenele matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Utimbo uli mchiya ng'auhunguke baye, na ghamapfuta ighali msupa ng'aghamalile baye, ka pfipfila lilonga lya IMNDEWA lyayamlongele Eliya yalonge.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eliya komtsilihula imwana iyafile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Hambele chidogho imwana wa ipinga ayo chitsuka yana ing'anda kaghula, na utamu awo uwa mkulu mbaka umkoma. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Kuya ipinga ayo kamlongela Eliya, “Ghwe munu wa Imulungu, una choni na nene? Angu kutsa kukumbusa inzambi yangu na kunikomela imwanangu?”<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Lekeni Eliya kamlongela, “Ungaye imwanagho.” Eliya kamsola imwana ayo mmambagha mwa mai wake, kamghala kuna ichiheleto ichili kuchanya chayang'ali yokala kuya kamuwatsisa mlutsatsi mwake. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Baho kamlilila IMNDEWA apfino, “Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu, angu kumghalila ghehile aghano ipinga ayuno chitsuka yanikala naye, na kumkomela imwanaghe?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Kuya Eliya kamuwasila mchanya imwana ayo mala ndatu na kamlomba IMNDEWA apfino, “Umtende imwana ayuno yahumule keli.” <verse eid="1KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />IMNDEWA kahulika chayalombile Eliya, na imwana baho katsilihuka, kanza ukuhumla keli. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Eliya kamsola imwana, kamhulumsa kulawa kuchanya mbaka hasi kwayakalile mai wake, kamlongela, “Lola! Imwanagho mgima.” <verse eid="1KI 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Apfo ipinga ayo kalonga, “Sambi nomanya ghendo ka ghweghwe kwa munu wa Imulungu, na malonga ghayakwingi'ile IMNDEWA ughalonge gholengesa ghendo.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Eliya na nabii Baali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Matsuwa mengi haghabitile, longa lya IMNDEWA limtsila Eliya mna ghumwaka ghwa kadatu ghulihela mvula, lilonga, “Ghenda wikelanguse kwa mfalume Ahabu, kuya nene nitsoghala mvula muisi.” <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Apfo Eliya kaghenda kwilangusa mwenyegho kwa Ahabu. Mna ghamatsuwa agho tsakuna nzala ng'ulu ako Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Lelo Ahabu kamkema Obadia, mwimilitsi wa ing'anda ya chifalume. Obadia tsakampfuka IMNDEWA Sideke. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Yezebeli hayang'ali yowakoma manabii wa IMNDEWA, Obadia kawasola manabii miya imwe kawapfisa mna mango mbili, hamsini mna chila mango, yang'ali yowaghalila ichijo na ghamatsi. <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Kuya Ahabu kamlongela Obadia, “Ghenda mna isi yose mna tsimbwibwi tsose tsa ghamatsi, na mna ulwanda, songaha toyona mitsani ya ukuweng'a wafalasi na punda falasi wetu, ili wawe wagima na tuleke ukuwaghisa wanyama wose.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Apfo waighola isi ayo, wadahe kuighendela yose, Ahabu kaghenda ubali umwe na Obadia kaghenda ubali ungi.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Obadia hayang'ali kamnzila koghenda, ketingana na Eliya, baho Obadia kamtanga, kamwinamila mbaka hasi na kalonga, “Angu ghweghwe kwa Eliya, mkulu wangu?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Naye kamwidika, “Ona nene, ghenda kamlongele mkulu wako ka nene Eliya nabaha.”<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Obadia kamghutsa, “Nitendile choni mbaka kongala kuna ghamoko gha Ahabu yakanikome? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Neleha kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako iyali mgima, kuduhu isi wala ufalume, mkulu wangu iyalekile kutuma wanu wakubame ghweghwe. Isi yoyose, au ufalume wowose wang'alonga ka ng'awakonile baye, mkulu wangu Ahabu komtenda mfalume wa isi ayo yelahe ka ng'awakonile baye. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Lekeni sambi ghweghwe kolonga, ‘Ghenda ukamlongele, Eliya kabaha.’ <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Simanyile baye ghumuhe ghwa IMNDEWA kwani kwaghutsokughala hanitsokuleka. Ning'aghenda kumlongela Ahabu ka ghweghwe kwabaha, naye ng'okona baye, yeye katsonikoma, hata ka nene na mtumighwa wako yanimpfukile IMNDEWA kulawa udodo wangu. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Angu ng'uhulike baye mkulu wangu, chanitendile ahala Yezebeli hayawakomile manabii wa IMNDEWA, apfila pfaniwapfisile manabii miya imwe mna tsimango mbili, hamsini mna chila mango, na niwaghalila ichijo na ghamatsi? <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Lekeni sambi ghweghwe konongela ng'ende kwa mkulu wangu nikamlongele, ‘Eliya kabaha.’ Baye katsonikoma ghendo.”<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Eliya kalonga, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu iyali mgima, yana ingupfu yanimsang'anila, leloli aino nitselangusa kwa Ahabu.”<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Apfo Obadia kaghenda kwitingana na Ahabu, kamlongela ka Eliya koneka, naye Ahabu kaghenda kwitingana na Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Ahabu hayamwonile Eliya, kamlongela, “Angu ayu ghweghwe, yuidununza Isiraeli?” <verse eid="1KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Eliya kamwidika, “Nene siidununze baye isi ya Isiraeli, yamuidununze Isiraeli ghweghwe na iwanu wa ikaye ya aba wako, kwaapfila mghaleka ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA na muitambikila milungu ya Mabaali. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Apfo lelo nikemeleni Waisiraeli wose watse twitingane na nene hana ichidunda cha Karimeli, pfipfila wakeme manabii awala miya nne na hamsini wa Baali, na manabii miya nne wa Ashera, iwajagha hana imetsa ya Yezebeli.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Apfo Ahabu kawakema Waisiraeli wose na kawakema hamwe manabii wose wetingane kuna ichidunda cha Karimeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Eliya kawasoghelela iwanu wose habehi, kawalongela, “Angu mwemwe mtsakwalangula mbuli mbili mbaka tsuwachi? Ka IMNDEWA ka Imulungu, muinzeni yeye, na ka Baali ka Imulungu muwinzeni yeye.” Iwanu ng'awedike chinu chochose baye. <verse eid="1KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Kuya Eliya kawalongela iwanu apfino, “Nene niliyeka yanisighale, inabii wa IMNDEWA, lekeni manabii wa Baali wa miya nne na hamsini. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Tughalileni ng'ombe weli, walekeni wasaghule ng'ombe yumwe, wamchinje na wamgane pfihandepfihande na weke mna tsingondi, lekeni waleke kutuwa ghumoto. Na nene nitsomganagana pfihande ing'ombe iyakalile, na sitsotuwa ghumoto baye. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Namwe mlombe kwa taghwa lya mulungu wenu, na nene nolomba kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA, na Imulungu ayula iyakwidika kwa kughala ghumoto, ayo yuyo Imulungu ghendo.” Nawo iwanu wose wedika, “Ona gholoko! Kulonga ghoya.”<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Kuya Eliya kawalongela manabii wa Baali, “Tanu mwisaghulile wenyegho ng'ombe yumwe, na mwanze kumgana gana, kwaapfila mwemwe mwa wengi, kuya mlilombe taghwa lya mlungu wenu, lekeni mleke kutuwa ghumoto mna tsingodi.”<verse eid="1KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Apfo wamsola ing'ombe ayo yaweng'ighwe, wamgana gana na walikema taghwa lya Baali kulawa nemitondo mbaka nemisi, walomba apfino. “Ghwe Baali utwidike,” Lekeni tsakuduhu litsi, wala imunu iyawedike. Nawo wang'ali wobighabigha kutsunguluka imatsabahu yawatsengile.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Haipfikile nemisi Eliya kawabetsa kalonga, “Mlombeni kwa ukukemelela! Yeye kamulungu, songaa kakwalangula. Imane kolota, au kaghenda kucholo, au kammwanza, au kawasa, na latsima yalamke.” <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Manabii wa Baali wakemelela, na weganagana na mimaghe na pfimaghe pfidopfido ka pfawatsowele mbaka idamu iwalawa. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Waghendelela kukemelela misi yose mbaka nemihe hachipfikile ichipindi cha ukulafa inambiko. Lekeni tsakuduhu litsi, wala iyedike, wala iyalolile. <verse eid="1KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Eliya kuya kawalongela iwanu, “Sogheleni hana nene.” Na iwanu wose wamsoghelela. Naye katsenga keli imatsabau ya IMNDEWA, aila ihinyighwe. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Eliya kasola mabwe kumi na meli, chila libwe kwa chila kabila lya iwana wa Yakobu, yeye IMNDEWA iyamlongele, “Taghwa lyako kutsokemighwa Isiraeli.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Kwa ghamabwe agho Eliya kamtsengela IMNDEWA imatsabahu, kahimba mfeleji kutsunguluka imatsabahu ayo, ighudaha kumema ka debe limwe lya matsi. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Katsika ghoya tsingodi atsila hana imatsabahu, kuya kamgana ing'ombe ayula pfihandepfihande, na kapfika mchanya mwa itsingodi. Kuya kawalongela iwanu, “Ghamemeseni mabigha mane gha matsi na mghaghide mchanya mwa inambiko aino ya ukulakatsighwa na mchanya mwa tsingodi atsino.” <verse eid="1KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Kuya kawalongela, “Tendeni lwa keli,” na watenda pfipfo lwa keli. Kawalongela keli, “Tendeni lwa kadatu”, nawo watenda lwa kadatu, <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Aghala ghamatsi ghapfosa kutsunguluka imatsabahu, na ghumfeleji ghose ghumema ghamatsi.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Na ichipindi cha ukulapfa nambiko tsa nemihe hachipfikile, nabii Eliya kasoghela habehi na kulomba, “Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Abrahamu, na wa Isaka, na wa Isiraeli, leloli wamanye ka ghweghwe kwa Imulungu mna Isiraeli, na wamanye ka nene na mtumighwa wako na nenda aghano ghose kwa kulaghitsighwa na ghweghwe. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Ghwe Imulungu unyidike. Unyidike ili iwanu awano wamanye ghendo ka ghweghwe IMNDEWA yuyo Imulungu, na wamanye ghendo ka ghweghwe yuyo yutenda imimoyo yawo ikuhundukile keli ghweghwe.”<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Baho IMNDEWA kahulumsa moto, ghulakatsa inambiko ya inyama ya ukulakatsighwa, na tsingodi, na ghamabwe, na lidongo, na ghunyalitsa ghamatsi ghose ighali mna ghumfeleji. <verse eid="1KI 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Iwanu wose hawonile apfo, waghwa hasi chifudifudi walonga, “IMNDEWA, yuyo Imulungu, IMNDEWA, yuyo Imulungu.” <verse eid="1KI 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Kuya Eliya kawalongela iwanu, “Waghogheni manabii wose wa Baali, mleke kumleka hata yumwe yatsume.” Apfo wawaghogha na Eliya kawahulumsa kuna ichikolongo cha Kishoni, na kuko kawakoma.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukumala kwa ukame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Kuya Eliya kamlongela Ahabu, “Ghenda ukaje na kunwa, kwaapfila nohulika mdumo ghwa mvula ng'ulu.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Apfo Ahabu kaghenda ukuja na ukunwa, lekeni Eliya kagheluka mbaka hana ichidanando cha ichidunda cha karimeli, kuko kenamila hasi mbaka ichihanga chake chidonza ghamafindi. <verse eid="1KI 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Kamlongela mtumighwa wake, “Ghenda ukalole ibahali.” Naye kaghenda kalola, kuya kalonga. “Sonile chinu baye.” Kamlongela, “Ghenda,” mala saba. <verse eid="1KI 18:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Hayaghendile lwa saba, imtumighwa koya, kalonga, “Lola, libingu lyolawa mna ibahali, nalyo dodo ka chighanza cha moko ghwa munu.” Baho Eliya kalonga, “Ghenda ukamlongele mfalume Ahabu yeke ghoya ghumtuka ghwake na yahulumke kuhisi ng'ana imvula imkwamise baye.” <verse eid="1KI 18:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Bahala kulawila bingu titu kulanga, na beho iliduma, na mvula ng'ulu itowa. Ahabu kadina ghumtuka ghwake kaghenda Yezireeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Ingupfu ya IMNDEWA imtsila Eliya, keyoha gholole lyake ghoya mchuno, katsuma kamlongolela Ahabu kupfika Yezreeli.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Eliya kamna ichidunda Sinai.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Mfalume Ahabu kampetela Yezebeli, imwehe wake, ghose ghayatendile Eliya na pfayawakomile manabii wa mulungu Baali kwa lipanga. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Baho Yezebeli katuma munu yaghende kwa Eliya, kalonga, “Ayo imilungu initowe pfipfo, na inikome ghendo, ka ilupfi chipindi ka achino nene sitsokutendela ghweghwe aghala ghauwatendile manabii awo.” <verse eid="1KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Apfo Eliya kapfuka, kenuka katsuma yaleke ukukomighwa. Kaghenda Beerisheba, ghumji ighuli muisi mwa Yuda, kamleka baho mtumighwa wake, <verse eid="1KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />lekeni yeye mwenyegho kanga misi yose mna inyika. Kapfika hana ghumbiki ghwa mretemu kakala mchimbeho, kalomba yaleke ukufa, kalonga, “Nyipfa, ghwe IMNDEWA, sola ugima wangu, nene sinoghile baye kubita sekulu tsangu.”<verse eid="1KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Apfo Eliya kawasa hasi hana ghumbiki aghwo, baho tsinongo tsimtsa. Kuya malaika wa Imulungu kamkinda, kamlongela, “Winuke uje chijo.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Eliya hayalolile, kona chighate chokighwa mna ghamakala gha ghumoto, na chibuyu cha ghamatsi habehi na litwi lyake. Kaja, kanwa, kuya kawasa keli. <verse eid="1KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Malaika wa Imulungu kamlawila lwakeli, kamkinda kamlongela, “Winuke uje, kwaapfila kwaughenda kutali.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Naye kenuka, kaja na kanwa. Kuya kanga chilo na misi kwa matsuwa alubaini kwa ngupfu ya ichijo acho mbaka kapfika Horebu, ichidunda cha Imulungu. <verse eid="1KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Kuko kapfikila hana imango, na ichilo acho kawasa baho. Kuya Longa lya IMNDEWA, limtsila na limlongela, “Eliya, utenda choni ahano?”<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Kamwidika, “Nene nilapfa kuna ghweghwe, na nikutumikila kwa ngupfu tsangu tsose, ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu yuna ingupfu, lekeni iwanu wa Isiraeli walilema lilaghano lyako, watsihinya tsimatsabahu tsako, na wawakoma manabii wako na limaghe. Nene niliyeka yanisighale mgima, nawo wobama wanikome.”<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Ghenda ukeme kuchidunda hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA, kwaapfila nene nofosa.” Apfo kulawila beho kulu, lina ingupfu lighwisa ipfidunda na litulatula ghamabambalawe, lekeni IMNDEWA ng'akalile mumo baye mna libeho. Libeho halimalile, kulawila mhighisiko ghwa isi, lekeni IMNDEWA ng'akalile mumo baye mna ghumhighisiko. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Na mhighisiko ghwa isi haghumalile, kulawila moto. Lekeni IMNDEWA ng'akalile mumo baye mna ghumoto aghwo, na ghumoto haghumalile, baho kulawila litsi ilinong'ona lughalugha. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Eliya hayahulike apfo, keghubika ichihanga chake kwa gholole lyake, kalawa na kema haukwingilila hana imango. Kuya kulawila litsi limlongela, “Eliya, utenda choni ahano?”<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Kamwidika, “Nene nilapfa kuna ghweghwe, na nikutumikila kwa ngupfu tsangu tsose, ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu yuna ingupfu, lekeni iwanu wa Isiraeli walilema lilaghano lyako, watsihinya tsimatsabahu tsako, na wawakoma manabii wako na limaghe. Nene niliyeka yanisighale mgima, nawo wobama wanikome.”<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Eliya, “Uye kuchughu, wang'ile inzila ya inyika ya Damasko, haupfika ako umbake mapfuta Hazaeli yawe mfalume wa Siriya. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Pfipfila umbake ghamapfuta Yehu imwanaghe Nimshi, yawe mfalume wa Isiraeli, na umbake ghamapfuta Elisha imwanaghe Shafati wa Abeli Mehola, yawe nabii yakinde hanu hako. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Munu wowose iyatsotsuma yaleke kukomighwa na Hazaeli, Yehu katsomkoma, na ayula iyatsotsuma yaleke kukomighwa na Yehu, Elisha katsomkoma. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Lekeni kuna wanu elufu saba iwali wagima mna isi ya Isiraeli, awala ng'ana wamtowele magoti baye mulungu Baali, wala milomo yawo ng'ana imnonele baye.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukukemighwa kwa Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Apfo Eliya koka kampfika Elisha mwana Shafati, kolima. Tsakuna ng'ombe ishirini na nne, iwolima weliweli, naye Elisha yang'ali yowemilila wang'ombe awala weli iwali kuchughu. Eliya kafosa habehi naye, kamwasila ligholole lyake. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Baho Elisha kawaleka wang'ombe wake, kamtsumila Eliya na kamlongela, “Undeke mbuke nikawawaghe aba wangu na mame wangu, kuya nitsokuwinza.” Kuya Eliya kamlongela, “Ghenda, Angu nene nikughoma?”<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Elisha kamleka Eliya, koya. Kawasola wang'ombe wake weli na kawachinja na kambika inyama kwa imibiki aila yawolimila wang'ombe, kaweng'a iwanu, waja. Kuya koka kamuwinza Eliya, na kamtumikila Eliya.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Ing'ondo ako Siria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Mfalume Beni Hadadi wa Siria kawakema iwanu wake wose wa ing'ondo, akuno kelengotsa na wafalume salasini na weli wana wafalasi na mituka yawo, kagheluka kuna ghumji ghwa Samaria, kaghutsingila na kaghutowa. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Kuya katuma wanu waghende kuna ghumji, kwa mfalume Ahabu wa Isiraeli, wamlongela, “Mfalume Beni Hadadi kolonga apfino, <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />‘Fetsa tsako na nzahabu tsako tsakwangu, na wehe wako wanoghile na iwanagho wose wakwangu.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Naye mfalume wa Isiraeli kedika, “Iwe pfipfo ka pfaulongile, nene na pfose pfanili napfo pfakwako.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Hambele iwanu wamghendela keli na wamlongela, “Beni Hadadi kolonga apfino, ‘Nikutumila wanu wakulongela ungaye pfetsa na tsahabu tsako, wehe wako na wanagho. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Lelo ilupfi chipindi ka achino nitsotuma watumighwa wangu watse wabamebame mna ing'anda yako ya chifalume na tsing'anda tsa watumighwa wako, na watsosola chila chinu chaukona ghweghwe chinogha.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Mfalume Ahabu kawakema iwanzehe wose wa isi, kawalongela, “Mloleni imunu ayuno pfoyobama kwisonga, kwaapfila katuma wanu kuna nene, kobama wehe wangu na wanangu na nzahabu tsangu na fetsa tsangu, na nene simlemele baye.”<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Iwanzehe awo na iwanu wose wamwidika, “Leka kumtegheletsa wala kumtogholela chayobama.”<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Apfo kawedika iwanu iyawatumile Beni Hadadi apfino, “Mlongele apfino mkulu wangu mfalume, ‘Mtumwa wako katsotenda ghose ghawanzile kubama, lekeni alino lya keli, nene silidaha baye.’” Iwanu awo woka, waghenda kumlongela Beni Hadadi. <verse eid="1KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Baho Beni Hadadi kamtumila nume Ahabu kalonga, “Imilungu inikome ka ako Samaria kutsosighala timbwisi ghawo limwe lya chila yumwe wa iwanu wangu iwali wengi.”<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Ahabu kedika, “Mlongeleni Beni Hadadi apfino, ‘Asikali iyadahile ukwitowa pfinoghile ketunya ahala ing'ondo haimala, wala ng'etunya baye ahala ing'ondo haikwanza.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Beni Hadadi hayahulike chayalongile mfalume Ahabu, naye yayang'ali yakunwa mbwali hamwe na wafalume wayaghe mna ghamahema ghawo, baho kawalongela iwanu wake, “Mkale ghoya kwa kwitowa.” Apfo wakala ghoya kwa ukughutowa ghumji.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Baho nabii yumwe kamghendela mfalume Ahabu wa Isiraeli, kalonga, “IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Pfihi kowona iwanu awano pfawali wengi, leloli nitsoweka mna ghumoko ghwako, naghwe kutsomanya ka nene na IMNDEWA.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Ahabu kamghutsa “Yuhi iyatsotenda apfo?” Inabii ayo kamwidika, “IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Maasikali wasongolo wa iwakulu wa majimbo watsotenda apfo.’ ” Ahabu kamghutsa “Yuhi yolongola kuwatowa?” Nabii kamwidika, “Ghweghwe.”<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Ahabu kawakema hamwe asikali wasongolo wa iwakulu wa ghamajimbo miya mbili na salasini na weli. Kuya kawakema asikali wa Isiraeli elufu saba.<verse eid="1KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Waghenda kuwatowa nemisi, aku Beni Hadadi na wafalume salasini na weli iwamwapfile wang'ali wakunwa imbwali na ukapatika mna ghamahema ghawo. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Maasikali wasongolo awo walongola. Beni Hadadi naye tsakatuma wapelembi chinyele, nawo wamlongela, “Kuna wanu wakutsa wolawa Samaria.” <verse eid="1KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Beni Hadadi kawalongela, “Waghogheni akuno wawagima, ka wakutsa kwa kwitowa, au ka wakutsa kwa kwipatana.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Asikali wasongolo walongola kulawa kunze kwa ghumji, aku asikali wa Isiraeli wakuchughu kwao. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Na chila munu kamkoma imunu iyetowile naye, wanu wa Siria watsuma, akuno Waisiraeli wowawinga. Lekeni Beni Hadadi mfalume wa Siria kahoneka, kwaapfila tsakatsuma kwa kudina ifalasi wake, hamwe na asikali wake iwadinile falasi wawo. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Mfalume wa Isiraeli kalawa, kaghenda kuwaghogha wafalasi na imituka, na kawakoma wanu wengi wa Siria.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Kuya inabii ayula iyamlawile mfalume wa Isiraeli, kamlongela, “Ghenda ukaweke ghoya asikali wako, na walangule keli choni cha ukutenda kwapfila ghumwaka ghukutsa mfalume wa Siria katsakutsa yakutowe.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waaramu wotowighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Iwatumighwa wa mfalume wa Beni hadadi wamlongela apfino, “Tsatutwowighwa kwaapfila milungu ya Waisiraeli tsa milungu ya kupfidunda, lekeni tung'etowa nawo mna isi ya ichiwala, tutsowatowa ghendo. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Tenda apfino, wawinge wafalume awo, chila mfalume yalawe hanu hake hayolongotsa, na uweke wakulu wa ing'ondo. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Kuya usaghule asikali ka awala yuwaghitse, na wafalasi ka awala iwaghile, na usaghule mituka ya ukukwegha ka aila iyaghile. Kuya twitsetowa nawo mchiwala na tutsowatowa ghendo.” Mfalume Beni Hadadi kahulika chawalongile na katenda pfipfo. <verse eid="1KI 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Msimu ghwa chipfeghetsi haghumalile, mfalume Beni Hadadi kawakema iwanu wake kaghenda nawo Afeki kwitowa na Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Nawo Waisraeli wakemighwa, weng'ighwa tsisilaha, woka na waghenda kwitingana nawo. Waisiraeli waghenda kukala ako aku welola nawo, na woneka ka pfikingili pfili pfa mene, lekeni Wasiria tsawenela isi yose.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Imunu wa Imulungu kamghendela mfalume wa Isiraeli, kamlongela, “IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Kwaapfila iwanu wa Siria wolonga IMNDEWA ka Imulungu wa ipfidunda na si Mulungu wa ipfiwala baye, Apfo nitsokwing'a iwanu awano iwali wengi mmoko mwako, naghwe kutsomanya ghendo ka nene na IMNDEWA.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Kwa matsuwa saba wanu wa Siria na Waisiraeli wakala mna tsindalo tsawo, akuno welolesa na mna litsuwa lya saba wanza kwitowa, na mna litsuwa lilyo Waisiraeli wawakoma asikali laki imwe wa Siria iwoghenda kwa maghulu.<verse eid="1KI 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Wanu wamwenga watsumila mna ghumji ghwa Afeki, kuko ubanda uwaghwila, na wanu elufu ishilini na saba wakomighwa. Na Beni Hadadi katsumila kuna ghumji na kepfisa mna chiheleto chimwe cha mghati. <verse eid="1KI 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Iwatumighwa wake waghenda kumlongela, “Lola, tuhulika ghendo ka wafalume wa Isiraeli wana libatsi sideke. Utuleke tohe maghunila mpfuno mwetu na mitsabi mmatwi mwetu, songaha katsokuleka uwe mgima.” <verse eid="1KI 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Apfo wapfala maghunila ghawo mchuno na mitsabi mwitwi mwawo, waghenda kwa mfalume wa Isiraeli na wamlongela, “Mtumighwa wako Beni Hadadi kolonga apfino, ‘Undeke niwe mgima.’” Mfalume naye kamwidika, “Pfihi yang'ali mgima? Yeye kandughu yangu.”<verse eid="1KI 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Watumighwa wa Ben Hadadi wang'ali wololela ka mfalume kowedika pfinoghile au baye, apfo Ahabu hayalongile apfo wawo wedikila himahima, “Ona, ndughu yako Beni Hadadi.” Mfalume kawalongela, “Mghende mkandetele.” Naye Beni Hadadi kamghendela, na Ahabu kamdinitsa mna ghumtuka ghwake. <verse eid="1KI 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Beni Hadadi kamlongela “Imiji yose aba wangu iyambokile aba wako nitsoiyitsa. Naghwe wike maghulilo ako Damasko, ka pfayatendile aba wangu ako Samaria.” Ahabu kamwidika, “Kwaapfila kulonga apfo, nokulekelela.” Apfo keka laghano naye na kamleka yoke.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nabii komlighita Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Kwa laghitso lya IMNDEWA, munu yumwe mna manabi, kamlongela miyaghe, “Nitowe,” lekeni miyaghe ayo kalema ukumtowa. <verse eid="1KI 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Apfo inabii kamlongela, “Kwapfila ng'umtegheletse baye IMNDEWA, baho haundeka uke isimba katsokukoma.” Na baho hayokile isimba kamwona kamkoma.<verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Inabii kamwona munu yungi na kamlongela, “Nitowe.” Apfo imunu ayo kamtowa na kamlagha. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Kuya nabii koka, na kambeta mfalume mmbalimbali mwa inzila, akuno kaghubika nenge tsake na chitambala, yaleke kutangika. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Na mfalume hayang'ali kofosa, inabii kamkemelela na kamlongela, “Mtumighwa wako ning'ali nitowa kwing'ondo, katsa asikali yumwe, kandetela imunu iyamghoghile, kanongela, ‘Undolele imunu ayuno, yang'atsuma kutsoliha ugima wako au kutsoliha kilo salasini na nne tsa fetsa.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Lekeni nene mtumwa wako haning'ali nisang'ana ng'onde tsingi, imunu ayo katsuma.” Mfalume wa Isiraeli kamlongela, “Apfo pfipfo pfautsohighighwa, kwihigha ghumwenyegho.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Inabii ayo kapambula himahima ichitambala acho mnange, na mfalume wa Isiraeli baho kamtanga ka yumwe wa manabii. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Kamlongela mfalume apfino, IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, Kwapfila kumlekelela imunu ayula yanibamile yakomighwe, lelo kutsokomighwa ghweghwe, lekeni yeye ng'okomighwa baye, na iwanu wako watsokomighwa, lekeni wakwake ng'awatso komighwa baye. <verse eid="1KI 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Apfo mfalume wa Isiraeli koka ukaye yake Samaria kuna ing'anda yake ya chifalume aku kaghudubuka na kana usungu.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Mghunda ghwa minzabibu ghwa Naboti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Naboti munu wa Yezireeli tsakana mghunda ghwake ghwa mitsabibu ako Yezireeli, habehi na ing'anda ya mfalume Ahabu wa Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Ahabu kamlongela Naboti, “Ungaye mghunda ghwako ghwa minzabibu ndime tsimbogha, kwaapfila ghwa habehi na ing'anda yangu. Nene nitsokwing'a mghunda ghungi ghunoghile ghwa minzabibu, au nitsokuliha chochose chubama.”<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Lekeni Naboti kamwidika, “IMNDEWA yayase kutali imbuli ayo ya ukukwing'a ghweghwe ghumghunda ghwawandekele iwahenga wangu.”<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Apfo Ahabu koka ukaye, akuno kaghudubuka na kamema usungu, kwa achila chayalongile Naboti iyolawila Yezireeli ahala hayamlongele, “Sikwing'a baye ghumghunda ghwawandekele wahenga wangu.” Kawasa mlunanda mwake, chihanga chake chihundukila kungi, kalema ukuja. <verse eid="1KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Pinga wake iyakemighwe Yezebeli kamghendela kamghutsa, “Heule ukwona usungu mbaka kwefeya ukuja?”<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Naye Ahabu kamwidika, “Kwaapfila nimlongela Naboti apfino, ‘Uniutsile mghunda ghwako ghwa minzabibu, ung'abama, nitsokuyitsila mghunda ghungi ghwa mitsabibu.’ Lekeni yeye kanongela, ‘Sikwing'a baye mghunda ghwangu.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Baho Yezebeli kamlongela, “Angu iyotawala Isiraeli nani? Angu si ghweghwe baye? Winuke uje, na usangalale, nene mwenyegho nitsokwing'a ghumghunda ghwa minzabibu ghwa Naboti, Myezireeli!”<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Apfo Yezebeli kandika baluwa kwa taghwa lya mfalume Ahabu, keka muhuli ghwa mfalume. Kuya katsituma kwa iwanzehe na iwanu iwomanyika iwokala na Naboti ako kuna ghumji ghwake. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Mna tsibaluwa atso kandika apfino, “Mkemelele iwanu wafunge, kuya mmwike Naboti yakale hana ichighoda cha iwakulu hambele ha iwanu. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Kuya wabameni wanu weli waghutsu ghendo, wakale akuno welolesa naye, nawo wambangitsile ghamaghomba walonge, ‘Ghweghwe kumlighita Imulungu na mfalume. Kuya mlapfeni kunze, mumtowe na mabwe mbaka yafe.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Apfo iwanzehe na iwanu iwomanyika iwokala mna ghumji ghwa Naboti watenda ka Yezebeli pfayawalongele mna tsibaluwa tsayawatumile. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Wakemelela litsuwa lya ukufunga, na wamwika Naboti yakale hanu ha ukulu haghati ha iwanu. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Waghutsu weli wakala akuno welolesa naye na wamlapfila maghomba Naboti hambele ha iwanu walonga, “Naboti kamlighita Imulungu na mfalume.” Apfo wamsola wamghala kunze kwa ghumji, wamtowa na mabwe mbaka kafa. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Kuya watuma nume kwa Yezebeli walonga, “Naboti katowighwa na mabwe mbaka kafa.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Yezebeli hayahulike ka Naboti kafa kwa ukutowighwa na ghamabwe, kamlongela Ahabu, “Winuke, ughende ukasole ghumghunda ghwa minzabibu ghwa Naboti, Myezireeli ghwayalemile ukukuutsila. Si mgima keli baye, yeye kafa.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Ahabu hayahulike ka Naboti kafa, kenuka kaghenda kughusola ghumghunda ghwa minzabibu ghwa Naboti.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Kuya longa lya IMNDEWA limtsila Eliya wa Tishibe, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />“Uhulumke ughende uketingane na mfalume Ahabu wa Isiraeli. Sambi kamna ghumghunda ghwa minzabibu ghwa Naboti, kobama yaghusole ghuwe ghwake. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Mlongele apfino, apfi pfipfo pfayolonga IMNDEWA, ‘Angu ghweghwe ng'umkomile imunu baye, kuya kusola ghumghunda ghwake?’ Kuya mlongele apfino, ‘Apfi pfipfo pfayolonga IMNDEWA, hanu ahala wambwa hawalambite idamu ya Naboti, baho wambwa watsolambita idamu yako, ona, idamu yako ghendo!’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Ahabu kamlongela Eliya, “Pfihi kunighogha, ghweghwe yunyihila?” Eliya Kamwidika, “Ona, nikughogha, kwaapfila ghweghwe kwilapfa ghendo mna ukutenda ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />‘Nitsokughalila ighehile kuna ghweghwe, na nitsokukoma ghendo na kumkoma chila munu mmale wa ikaye yako, yawe mtumwa au si mtumwa baye. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Kuya nitsowatenda iwanu wa ikaye yako wawe ka iwanu wa ikaye ya Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, na wawe ka iwanu wa ikaye ya Baasha mwana wa Ahiya, kwaapfila kunitenda nene nighudubuke, na kuwahonza Wasiraeli watende nzambi.’ <verse eid="1KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />Pfipfila IMNDEWA kanongela ka imwehe wako Yezebeli wambwa watsoluja ilukuli lwake mumno mghati mwa imibanda ako Yezireeli. <verse eid="1KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />Imunu wowose wa ikaye yako iyakufila mna ghumji, wambwa watsomja na ayula iyakufila kumghunda, wapfideghe wa mlanga watsomja.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />Tsakuduhu munu ka Ahabu iyelapfile mwenyegho ukutenda ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, aku mwehe wake Yezebeli komsongetsa. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Katenda pfinu pfa ukudesa ghendo kwa ukutambikila pfinyagho pfa imilungu ingi ka pfawatendile Waamori, IMNDEWA iyawawingile hambele ha iwanu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Ahabu hayahulike apfo, kadegha maghwanda ghake, kapfala maghunila, kalema ukuja, na kawasa mna ghamaghunila, na kanga akuno na ako kwa usungu mkulu. <verse eid="1KI 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Kuya Imbuli ya Imulungu imtsila Eliya, munu wa Tishibi. <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />“Angu kwakona, Ahabu pfayetendile mdodo hambele hangu? Kwaapfila yeye ketenda mdodo, sitsomghalila maghayo baye mna ghamatsuwa ghake, lekeni mna ghamatsuwa gha imwanaghe nitsoghaghala mna ing'anda yake.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Nabii Mikaya komkanya Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Kwa miyaka midatu tsakuduhu ng'ondo mna isi ya Isiraeli na Siriya. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kadatu mfalume Yehoshafati wa Yuda kahulumka kaghenda kumlola mfalume Ahabu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="1KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Mfalume Ahabu kawalongela watumighwa wake, “Angu ng'ammanyile baye ka ghumji ghwa Ramoti Gileadi ghwa kwetu, na ng'atutenda chinu chochose baye kughuyitsa kulawa kwa mfalume wa Siriya?” <verse eid="1KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Apfo kamghutsa Yehoshafati, “Pfihi kutsoghenda hamwe na nene kwitowa na Ramoti Gileadi?” Yehoshafati kamwidika Ahabu, “Nene na ghweghe twa chinu chimwe, wanu wangu ka wanu wako, na falasi wangu ka falasi wako.” <verse eid="1KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Lekeni Yehoshafati pfipfila kamlongela Ahabu, “Lekeni tanu umghutse IMNDEWA yolonga choni.”<verse eid="1KI 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Lelo mfalume Ahabu kawakema hamwe manabii wose iwopfika miya nne, kawaghutsa, “Pfihi ng'ende kughutowa ghumji ghwa Ramoti Gileadi au ndeke kughenda?” Nawo wamwidika, “Ghenda, IMNDEWA katsokwing'a mmoko mwako.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Lekeni Yehoshafati kaghutsa, “Angu ahano haduhu nabii wa IMNDEWA wa kumghutsa?”<verse eid="1KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Naye mfalume Ahabu wa Isiraeli kamwidika Yehoshafati, “Kabaha yumwe iyakalile, ayo twodaha kumghutsa IMNDEWA kubitila yeye, taghwa lyake Mikaya mwana wa Imla, lekeni nene nomwihila kwaapfila ng'olonga chinu chochose baye chinoghile mna nene, lekeni yeye kalongagha ghehile ghaliyeka.” Yehoshafati kedika, “Ng'apfinoghile baye mfalume yalonge apfo.”<verse eid="1KI 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Baho Ahabu kamkema mtumighwa wake yumwe kamlongela, “Ngalileni Mikaya mwana wa Imla sambi baha.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Apfo mfalume wa Isiraeli na mfalume Yehoshafati wa Yuda wakala mna ipfighoda pfawo pfa ufalume hana ichibwalu cha ukubetela, hana lilango lya ghumji, lya ukwingilila Samaria, na manabii wose wang'ali wotabiri hambele hawo. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Naye Sedekiya mwana wa Kenaana, yumwe wa manabii, ketengenetsela membe tsa chuma, kalonga, “IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Kwa tsimembe atsino kutsowoyitsa kuchughu Wasiriya mbaka wakomighwe.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Na awala manabii wamwenga wose wang'ali wolonga chinu chicho, walonga, “Ghenda ukaghutowe Ramoti Gileadi, na IMNDEWA katsomwika mfalume wake mna ghumoko ghwako.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Na imsenga ayula iyaghendile kumkema Mikaya, kamlongela, “Lola, manabii wose wolonga mfalume katsowatowa maaduwi, naghwe nokulomba utende ka wawo, utabili ighanoghile.”<verse eid="1KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Lekeni Mikaya kamwidika, “Neleha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima, nitsomlongela achila chayonongela IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Mikaya hayapfikile, mfalume kamghutsa, “Pfihi tughende tukaghutowe ghumji ghwa Ramoti Gileadi au tuleke kughenda?” Naye kamwidika, “Ghenda naghwe kutsoghutowa, IMNDEWA katsokwing'a ghumji aghwo mmoko mwako.”<verse eid="1KI 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Mfalume kamlongela, “Nikutenda wilahe mala ngapi ili haulonga na nene kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA ulonge igholongesa?”<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Kuya Mikaya kamwidika, “Niwona Waisraeli wapwililika mpfidunda ka wang'olo iwalihela mdimi, na IMNDEWA kalonga, ‘Iwanu awano wahela munu wa ukuwalongotsa, mleke chila munu yoke tseghamba ukaye yake.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Baho Ahabu kamlongela Yehoshafati, “Kwakona? Nene sikulongele baye ka yeye ng'alongagha ghanoghile baye kuna nene ila ighehile ghaliyeka?”<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Kuya Mikaya kalonga, “Lelo tegheletsa chayolonga IMNDEWA, nimwona IMNDEWA kakala hana ichighoda chake cha ufalume akuno malaika wema wamtsunguluka kujilo kwake na kumoso kwake. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Naye IMNDEWA kaghutsa, ‘Nani yatsombugha Ahabu yaghende yakakomighwe ako Ramoti Gileadi?’ Apfo ayuno kolonga apfino na yungi kolonga apfino. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Baho, muhe yumwe kema hambele ha IMNDEWA, kalonga, ‘Nene nitsombugha.’ <verse eid="1KI 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />IMNDEWA kamghutsa ‘Kwa nzila yachi?’ Naye kedika, ‘Nitsoghenda na kwitenda muhe wa ughutsu na kuwatenda manabii wake wose walonge ughutsu’ Imulungu kamlongela, ‘Ghweghwe kutsodaha ukumbugha, ghenda ukatende apfo.’”<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />“Apfo IMNDEWA kawatenda manabii wako wose walonge ughutsu. IMNDEWA kalonga ghehile ghakupate.”<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Sedekiya mwana wa Kenaana, kamsoghelela Mikaya, kamtowa mwikanza kuya kamghutsa, “Kulawa tsuwachi muhe wa IMNDEWA yandekile nene, na yatse kulonga na ghweghwe?”<verse eid="1KI 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikaya kamwidika, “Litsuwa haukwingila mna ichiheleto chili mghati kwipfisa, baho kutsomanya.”<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Ahabu kalaghitsa, “Msoleni Mikaya mmuyitse kwa Amoni, mkulu wa ghumji, na kwa Yoashi, mwana wa mfalume. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Kuya walongeleni wamwike mchifungo, na wamwing'e chighate chidogho, na ghamatsi mbaka nene hanikuya mgima.”<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Mikaya kalonga, “Ka kwakuya mgima, IMNDEWA ng'alongile na nene baye.” Kuya kaghendelela kulonga, “Mwemwe wanu wose mghakumbuke aghano!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Apfo mfalume Ahabu wa Isiraeli na mfalume Yehoshafati wa Yuda wawaghala iwakulu wawo wa ing'ondo kuna ghumji ghwa Ramoti Gileadi. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Mfalume Ahabu kamlongela Yehoshafati, “Hanighenda ukwitowa nene nitsopfala magwanda ghangu ghangi, lekeni ghweghwe pfala magwanda ghako gha chifalume.”<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Apfo mfalume wa Siriya kawalaghitsa iwakulu wa ing'ondo selasini na weli wa imituka ya ukukweghighwa na falasi, kawalongela, “Mleke ukwitowa na munu wowose ayula, yawe mdodo au mkulu, mwemwe mumtowe mfalume wa Isiraeli yaliyeka.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Iwakulu wa ing'ondo hawamwonile Yehoshafati walonga, “Ayuno ka mfalume wa Isiraeli ghendo.” Apfo wahunduka waghenda wakamtowe, lekeni Yehoshafati hayakemelele, <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />iwakulu wa ing'ondo watanga ka yeye si mfalume wa Isiraeli baye, apfo waleka ukumuwinzilitsa. <verse eid="1KI 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Lekeni munu yumwe kasa minde kamuhoma mfalume wa Isiraeli bila kumanya. Ahabu kamlongela iyakwendesa ghumtuka ghwake ghwa ukukweghighwa, “Yuitsa ghumtuka ghwako ghwa ukukweghighwa kuchughu, unilapfe akuno kuna ing'ondo, miyagho wandagha.”<verse eid="1KI 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Na ing'ondo tsayongetseka tsuwa alyo, akuno mfalume kaghamila ghumtuka ghwake ghwa ukukweghighwa, kelolesa na iwanu wa Siriya, na haipfikile nemihe kafa. Na idamu ilawile mna ipfilonda pfake yenela mghati mwa ghumtuka ghose. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Na litsuwa haling'ali litsama, maasikali wose walila, walonga, “Chila munu yoke ukaye yake, chila munu yoke mna isi yake.”<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Apfo mfalume Ahabu kafa na kasolighwa mbaka Samaria na wamtsika kuko. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Ghumtuka ghwake ghwa ukukweghighwa na falasi waghuhofugha mna litsimbu lya Samaria, na wambwa walambita idamu yake, nawo wapinga pfiweghe tsawogha mumo, ka longa lya IMNDEWA pfalilongile.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Ghangi ghayatendile Ahabu, na chila chinu chayatendile, na pfayatsengile ing'anda kwa membe tsa nembo, na imiji yose ina ubanda iyaitsengile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Ahabu kafa na mwanaghe Ahazia kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati mfalume wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Yehoshafati mwana wa Asa kanza kutawala mna isi ya Yuda mna ghumwaka ghwa kane ghwa utawala wa Ahabu mfalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yehoshafati tsakana miyaka selasini na tano hayawile mfalume, na katawala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka ishilini na tano, na mai wake tsakakemighwa Azuba neghe Shilihi. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Katenda ghaghala ghayatendile aba wake Asa, na ng'aghalekile baye, katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA. Ila ipfidanando pfa ukutambikila ng'apfihinyighwe baye, iwanu waghendelela kutambika na kudusula mapfumba mpfidanando apfo. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Yehoshafati pfipfila keleghana na mfalume wa Isiraeli wakale bila ukwitowa. <verse eid="1KI 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Ghangi ghayatendile Yehoshafati, ukulu wa ngupfu tsake, na apfila pfayadahile ukwitowa, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha kumbukumbu cha wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Kawawinga iwamale wose iwowasa na wamale wayao mna ipfidanando pfa ukutambikila, iwasighale muisi mna ghamatsuwa gha aba wake Asa. <verse eid="1KI 22:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Tsa kukala kuduhu mfalume mna isi ya Edomu, ila isi tsaitawalighwa na munu iyekighwe na mfalume wa Yuda yamwapfile. <verse eid="1KI 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Yehoshafati katengenetsa meli ng'ulu itsikemighwe Tarishishi, tsighende Ofiri kusola nzahabu, lekeni ng'atsipfikile ako baye kwaapfila tsatsihinyika ako Esioni Geberi. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Matsuwa ghagho Ahazia mwana Ahabu tsakamlongela Yehoshafati, “Waleke watumighwa wangu waghende na watumighwa wako mna tsimeli,” lekeni Yehoshafati kalemesa.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Naye Yehoshafati kafa na katsikighwa kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi. Na Yehoramu imwanaghe kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahazia mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Ahazia imwanaghe Ahabu kawa mfalume wa Isiraeli ako Samaria mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na saba ghwa ukutawala mfalume Yehoshafati wa Yuda, na katawala kwa miyaka mili ako Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, kwa ukutenda ghaghala ghawatendile aba wake Ahabu na mai wake Yezebeli, na ghaghala ghayatendile Yeroboamu mwanaghe Nebati, iyawahonzile Waisireli nawo watende nzambi. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Kamsang'anila mlungu Baali, na kamtambikila, na kamtenda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, yaghudubuke, ka pfayatendile aba wake.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>